        <rdfs:comment>In Phase 1, we conducted a genome-wide scan on germline DNA from 385 patients from the Australian Ovarian Cancer Study (AOCS, n = 183), the Mayo Clinic (MAYO, n = 68) and The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA, n = 134) and performed a meta-analysis summarizing results from these cohorts (refer to Methods for details of genotyping and imputation).</rdfs:comment>
