        <obo:IAO_0000115>A research and clinical centre at the University of California, Los Angeles, that investigates autism, provides patient care and trains researchers and clinicians working with autistic children and adults and their families.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym ACE also denotes Genome Research at Fundació ACE (COHO:0000258); this term is Center for Autism Research and Treatment.</obo:IAO_0000116>
