        <rdfs:comment>We prospectively recruited all consenting patients with recent stroke from the emergency department; medical, neurology, and occasionally other (e.g., surgical) wards; stroke unit; and neurovascular clinics of the Western General Hospital, Edinburgh, United Kingdom, between April 2002 and May 2005 into the Edinburgh Stroke Study</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


