        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multi-phase, stratified, cross-sectional population-based survey of school-aged children in rural regions of southern Germany, Austria and Switzerland and in Poland, run from 2006 within the EU-funded GABRIEL project: a screening questionnaire (phase I), a stratified random subsample with detailed farm-exposure questionnaires and blood, genetic and environmental samples (phase II), and in Bavaria an in-depth respiratory and environmental assessment (phase III), to determine the factors in farming environments that protect against asthma and atopic disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
