        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym PROFILE also denotes the Crohn&apos;s disease trial PRedicting Outcomes For Crohn&apos;s disease using a moLecular biomarker (COHO:0000320); this term is the prostate cancer risk study. The EGA study EGAS00001007958 tagged PROFILE is the Crohn&apos;s disease trial, not this cohort.</obo:IAO_0000116>
