        <rdfs:comment>For rs11656696 A we found a decreased glaucoma risk in the Amsterdam Glaucoma Study (AGS; OR = 0.71, 95%CI = 0.51–0.99) and the Erlangen and Tübingen study (OR = 0.82, 95%CI = 0.69–0.97), but not in RS-I and the Genetic Research in Isolated Populations (GRIP) program.</rdfs:comment>
