        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of families including siblings discordant for Alzheimer disease, with African-American and white family samples, assembled for genetic investigation through the Multi-Institutional Research on Alzheimer Genetic Epidemiology (MIRAGE) programme.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">MIRAGE also names a microRNA ageing score (mirAge) used in Rotterdam Study data; this term is the Multi-Institutional Research on Alzheimer Genetic Epidemiology study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
