        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of people aged 16–100 with Orcadian grandparents, recruited in Orkney, northern Scotland, in 2005–2011 for family-based investigation of genetic influences on cardiovascular and other complex-disease risks.</obo:IAO_0000115>
