        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym GENIE also denotes AACR Project GENIE (COHO:0000209), the cancer sequencing registry; this term is the Korean Gene-Environmental Interaction and phenotype study. The EGA study EGAS00001006707 tagged GENIE is the registry, not this cohort.</obo:IAO_0000116>
