        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90421033</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Proteogenomic analysis of human cerebrospinal fluid identifies neurologically relevant regulation and implicates causal proteins for Alzheimer&apos;s disease.</dcterms:title>
