        <rdfs:comment>Genomic datasets from ADNI, DIAN, Knight-ADRC (Oct 2021), Knight-ADRC (June 2023), MARS, FACE, and Barcelona-1 were genotyped on multiple arrays at different times and were imputed individually using the GRCh38 Version R2 reference panel on the TOPMed imputation server.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
