        <coho:isSubCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000470"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90086175</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of older men and women born in 1907–1935, drawn from the population-based Reykjavik Study followed in Iceland by the Icelandic Heart Association and re-examined from 2002 with detailed cardiovascular, neurocognitive, musculoskeletal and metabolic phenotypes to study genetic susceptibility and gene–environment interaction in disease and disability in old age.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AGES</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AGES-RS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AGES-Reykjavik</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Aging Gene-Environment Susceptibility - Reykjavik Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Age, Gene/Environment Susceptibility-Reykjavik Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90086175</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>A genome-wide association study of serum proteins reveals shared loci with common diseases.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35078996</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8789779/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We performed a GWAS of 4782 serum proteins encoded by 4135 unique human genes in the population-based AGES cohort of elderly Icelanders (n = 5368, Supplementary Data 1), measured by the slow-off rate modified aptamer (SOMAmer) platform as previously described8,18.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000378"/>
