        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cohort of older men and women born in 1907–1935, drawn from the population-based Reykjavik Study followed in Iceland by the Icelandic Heart Association and re-examined from 2002 with detailed cardiovascular, neurocognitive, musculoskeletal and metabolic phenotypes to study genetic susceptibility and gene–environment interaction in disease and disability in old age.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:17351290</obo:IAO_0000119>
