        <obo:IAO_0000115>A community-based cohort of 5,302 African American adults, including a nested family cohort, enrolled from the three counties of the Jackson, Mississippi metropolitan area, with extensive medical, social, physical and biochemical measurements and genomic DNA, to study cardiovascular and related diseases in African Americans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
