        <owl:annotatedTarget>A healthcare-based biobank of more than 140,000 consenting patients of the Mass General Brigham network in the Greater Boston area of Massachusetts, enrolled since 2010 at Massachusetts General Hospital, Brigham and Women’s Hospital and local sites, linking biological samples, genomic data and health records to study genetic and environmental influences on disease in clinical practice.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:41298473</obo:IAO_0000119>
