        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3554384/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition (EPIC)-Potsdam is part of the ongoing multicenter EPIC study and comprises 27,548 participants from the general population in the area of Potsdam in eastern Germany who were mainly 35–65 years of age at time of recruitment between 1994 and 1998 (17).</rdfs:comment>
