        <dcterms:title>Comprehensive genetic analysis of the human lipidome identifies loci associated with lipid homeostasis with links to coronary artery disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35668104</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A35668104+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We quantified 596 lipid species in serum from 4,492 individuals from the Busselton Health Study.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
