        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90670368</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association analyses highlight the role of the intestinal molecular environment in human gut microbiota variation.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41688638</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12987725/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Malmö offspring study (MOS) includes participants aged ≥18 years who are children or grandchildren of participants from the Malmö Diet and Cancer Study (MDC)—cardiovascular cohort, a subset of the larger MDC59.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
