        <obo:IAO_0000115>A national whole-genome sequencing programme of the Qatar Foundation that sequences volunteers from the Qatar Biobank and combines their genomes with the biobank&apos;s phenotype data to study the Qatari and wider Arab and Middle Eastern populations at the molecular level.</obo:IAO_0000115>
