        <rdfs:comment>Comparison of allele frequencies revealed that rs2605913 was present at 8.8% in the QGP cohort but occurred more frequently in the European dataset of 1000 Genomes (34.4%) (Table S2).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
