        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90128424</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium of principal investigators of cohort studies from the general population, clinical trials and disease-specific patient collections that have Olink proteomics and genome-wide genotyping data, combining summary-level data to discover and follow up genetic associations with plasma protein levels (pQTLs) and identify causal protein biomarkers of disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SCALLOP</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SCALLOP Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
