        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9047645/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a genome-wide association meta-analysis in up to 28 204 individuals from 14 cohorts in the SCALLOP Consortium for plasma ACE2 protein measured with the Olink platform.</rdfs:comment>
