        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A longitudinal cohort of volunteers aged over 60 in Australia, including people with Alzheimer&apos;s disease, mild cognitive impairment and healthy controls, recruited at centres in Perth and Melbourne and reassessed at 18-month intervals with cognitive testing, blood biomarkers, lifestyle questionnaires and amyloid PET and MRI imaging to study predictors of Alzheimer&apos;s disease and cognitive decline.</owl:annotatedTarget>
