        <rdfs:comment>To date, we have screened ∼6500 Amish adults for a variety of risk factors related to cardiovascular disease (Mitchell et al. 2008), diabetes (Hsueh et al. 2000), and osteoporosis (Streeten et al. 2006) as part of the Amish Complex Disease Research Program (ACDRP).</rdfs:comment>
