        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tri-ethnic longitudinal cohort of people of European, South Asian and African Caribbean ethnicity living in West and North London, United Kingdom, set up in 1988 to examine ethnic differences in chronic disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SABRE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Southall And Brent REvisited</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
