        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electronic health record-linked biobank founded in 2007 at the Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai that enrols participants non-selectively from the Mount Sinai Health System in New York City, comprising about 60,000 ancestrally diverse participants with genotype and sequence data for genetic and clinical research.</obo:IAO_0000115>
