        <obo:IAO_0000115>A family-based longitudinal cohort of index probands with laboratory-confirmed obstructive sleep apnoea, their relatives, and neighbourhood control families recruited from the Cleveland metropolitan area, Ohio, with four examinations between 1990 and 2006, designed to study the familial and genetic basis of sleep-disordered breathing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
