    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000431"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7939422/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Cohort members reside primarily in a 22-county service area in northern and central California that encompasses over 28,000 square miles and includes urban, suburban, rural and agricultural land use (supplementary Figure 1; http://links.lww.com/EE/A39).</rdfs:comment>
