        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90093140</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A longitudinal research programme of the University of Oulu comprising two general-population birth cohorts from the two northernmost provinces of Finland, Oulu and Lapland, the Northern Finland Birth Cohort 1966 (NFBC1966) and 1986 (NFBC1986), whose members have been followed since the fetal period to study health and well-being.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NFBC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Northern Finland Birth Cohorts - Research program for health and well-being</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
