        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90278615</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An ongoing prospective population biobank of more than 150,000 predominantly Han Chinese volunteers aged 20-70 recruited across Taiwan, with questionnaire, physical-measurement, biomarker and genome-wide genetic data and linkage to national health insurance records, built as a resource for biomedical and public health research in East Asia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TWB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Taiwan</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
