        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Netherlands"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90128543</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multi-site naturalistic longitudinal case-control cohort in the Netherlands of 2,981 adults aged 18-65, 2,329 with a current or remitted depressive and/or anxiety disorder and 652 healthy controls, recruited from 2004 in the general population, primary care and specialised mental health care in the regions of Amsterdam, Leiden and Groningen, extended from 2014 with 367 of their siblings to 3,348 participants and reassessed repeatedly over more than nine years, to study the aetiology, long-term course and consequences of depressive and anxiety disorders by integrating psychological, social, biological and genetic factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NESDA</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
