        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based prospective cohort from fetal life onwards of 9,778 mothers with delivery dates from April 2002 to January 2006 in Rotterdam, the Netherlands, and their children, designed to identify early environmental and genetic causes of normal and abnormal growth, development and health.</obo:IAO_0000115>
