    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000451"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9763692/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>As part of this study, genomics approaches were used to characterize 12,353 volunteer donors enrolled at four different blood centers across the United States of America (29, 30).</rdfs:comment>
