        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12218978/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a multicenter study using data from seven studies – TwinsUK (N = 3918), EPIC-Potsdam (N = 2192), PainOmics (N = 1873), SOCCS (N = 1742), SABRE (N = 544), QMDiab (N = 325), and CEDAR (N = 170) with a total sample size N = 10,764.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
