        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90267372</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electronic health record-linked biobank cohort of more than 170,000 patients of the University of Pennsylvania Health System (Penn Medicine), about 30% of non-European ancestry, who consented to link their health records to genomic and biomarker data and to recontact, for genomic discovery and precision medicine research.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym Penn also denotes UPenn Local TGCT Study (COHO:0001388); this term is Penn Medicine BioBank.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PMB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PMBB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
