        <dcterms:title>The genetic and phenotypic correlates of mtDNA copy number in a multi-ancestry cohort.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37255673</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A37255673+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To understand the biology of mtCN, we carried out genome- and phenome-wide association studies of mtCN in 30,666 individuals from the Penn Medicine BioBank (PMBB)-a diverse cohort of largely African and European ancestry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
