        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sweden"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90274758</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective, longitudinal cohort, the first Swedish BioFINDER study (BioFINDER-1, NCT01208675), of cognitively unimpaired older adults and patients with mild cognitive impairment, dementias and parkinsonian disorders, recruited from 2009 to 2014 at three neurology and memory clinics in southern Sweden and followed for up to 10 years with cerebrospinal fluid, plasma, MRI, amyloid PET and genetic data to develop early and accurate diagnosis of Alzheimer disease, Parkinson disease and related disorders. It is distinct from the later, independent BioFINDER-2 study (NCT03174938), launched in 2017.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BioFINDER</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BioFINDER One</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
