        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90276157</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A US data resource, founded in 1999 and funded by the National Institute on Aging, that combines the standardized longitudinal clinical (Uniform Data Set), neuropathology, imaging, biomarker and genetic data of participants of the NIA-funded Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Research Centers, more than 56,000 people from over 42 centers, for research on Alzheimer disease and related dementias.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym ADC also denotes Amsterdam Dementia Cohort (COHO:0000374); this term is National Alzheimer&apos;s Coordinating Center.</obo:IAO_0000116>
