        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6389173/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Individuals in these studies were sampled randomly from the Singapore population and a disproportionate sampling scheme was utilized to increase the sample sizes of Malays and Asian-Indians.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
