        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90627737</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electronic health record-linked biobank jointly developed by the University of Colorado Anschutz Medical Campus and UCHealth, enrolling adult UCHealth patients since September 2015 (more than 200,000 participants by 2022, mostly from the Rocky Mountain region), as a dual-purpose resource for genomic research and for returning clinical genetic results to participants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCPM</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCPM Biobank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
