        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90308732</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based prospective cohort of dementia-free adults aged 65 and older enrolled since 1994 from the membership of Kaiser Permanente Washington (formerly Group Health Cooperative) in the Seattle area, United States, and followed longitudinally to identify risk and preventive factors for dementia, with brain autopsy, genetic and abstracted medical-record data.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ACT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ACTS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
