        <rdfs:comment>HyperGEN (Hypertension Genetic Epidemiology Network) included field centers in Birmingham AL, which recruited African Americans; the rest of centers in Forsyth County, NC, in Framingham, MA, in Minneapolis, MN, and in Salt Lake City, UT recruited Whites.</rdfs:comment>
