        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective population-based biobank cohort of 156,701 Korean adults aged 20–85 recruited in 2004–2013 at 18 health promotion centres across Korea during routine health examinations, genotyped and followed through national mortality, cancer registry and health insurance records, to study cancer, cardiovascular and other chronic diseases and their metabolic risk factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
