        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90662856</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association studies in a large Korean cohort identify quantitative trait loci for 36 traits and illuminate their genetic architectures.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40436827</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12120081/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here we conducted GWAS for 36 quantitative traits from 153,950 individuals in the Korean Cancer Prevention Study-II (KCPS-II) Biobank22, a prospective cohort study of the Korean population with genomic data and a wide range of measured phenotypes.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
