        <rdfs:comment>Patients with a moderate to severe depressive episode were recruited from the hospital of the Max Planck Institute of Psychiatry and collaborating hospitals of Southern Bavaria and Switzerland.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


