        <obo:IAO_0000115>A longitudinal study of Australian twins aged 65 years and over, with some of their equivalently aged siblings, recruited through the Australian Twin Registry and a recruitment drive and assessed every two years with psychiatric, neuropsychological, cardiovascular, metabolic, neuroimaging and genetic measures, to study genetic and environmental influences on healthy brain ageing and ageing-related neurocognitive disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>OATS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Older Australian Twin Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
