        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>White WHI participants were drawn from three substudies: the Genome-wide Association Research Network into Effects of Treatment (GARNET) (National Institutes of Health 2013), Modification of PM-Mediated Arrhythmogenesis in Populations (MOPMAP) (National Institutes of Health 2010), and Women&apos;s Health Initiative Memory Study (WHIMS) (Shumaker et al. 1998).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


