        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genetically homogeneous sample of healthy Norwegian adults spanning the adult life span, collected from 2003 to study cognitive ageing and genetic risk factors and genome-wide genotyped in 2009, with MRI and experimental cognitive data on attention and working memory, for studies of the genetics of cognitive and brain function.</obo:IAO_0000115>
