        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:36324662</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A36324662+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>All individuals were drawn from the iPSYCH2012 case-cohort study, a nationally representative sample identified from Danish national registers.</rdfs:comment>
