        <owl:annotatedTarget>A longitudinal, multicentre, multinational family study of 4,953 members of 539 two-generation families selected for exceptional familial longevity, recruited in 2006-2009 through field centres in Boston, New York and Pittsburgh in the United States and in Denmark and re-examined in 2014-2017, to study the genetic and non-genetic determinants of exceptional longevity and healthy ageing.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34739053</obo:IAO_0000119>
