        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000516"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A18070814+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The primary aim of the Women&apos;s Genome Health Study (WGHS) is to create a comprehensive, fully searchable genome-wide database of &gt;360 000 single nucleotide polymorphisms among at least 25 000 initially healthy American women participating in the ongoing NIH-funded Women&apos;s Health Study (WHS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
