        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90672046</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of a random sample of 6,188 Caucasian adults aged 35 to 75 living in Lausanne, Switzerland, extensively phenotyped and genotyped genome-wide at baseline to study the prevalence and genetic determinants of cardiovascular risk factors and the metabolic syndrome, and followed up prospectively (with its psychiatric arm PsyCoLaus) from 2003 for cardiovascular events and mortality.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>COLAUS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CoLaus</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CoLaus Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cohort Lausanne</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Cohorte Lausannoise</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000522"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90672046</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetic determinants of zinc homeostasis and its role in cardiometabolic diseases.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41325371</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12677789/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We conducted a GWAS of urinary zinc levels in three prospective cohorts - SKIPOGH (Swiss Kidney Project on Genes in Hypertension, N = 896) [29,30], CoLaus|PsyCoLaus (Cohort Lausanne, N = 4,542) [31] and GCKD (German Chronic Kidney Disease study, N = 4,822) [32]</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
