        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90292534</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of 51,529 US male health professionals aged 40 to 75 enrolled in 1986, whose demographics, health, diet and lifestyle are updated by questionnaire every two years (diet every four), with follow-up exceeding 90% of eligible person-time.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym Harvard also denotes Mass General Brigham Biobank (COHO:0000383), Nurses&apos; Health Study (COHO:0000456) and Nurses&apos; Health Study II (COHO:0000619); this term is Health Professionals Follow-up Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
