        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90256400</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collaborative consortium that combines genome-wide association and exome-array data from many cohorts of individuals without diabetes in meta-analyses of glycaemic traits (fasting glucose, fasting insulin, 2-hour glucose and HbA1c) and measures of insulin secretion and sensitivity, to find loci influencing glycaemic and metabolic traits, and releases its summary results.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym MAGIC also denotes Molecular Genetics of Adverse Drug Reactions in Childhood Study (COHO:0000537); this term is Meta-Analyses of Glucose and Insulin-related traits Consortium.</obo:IAO_0000116>
