        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90244092</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pregnancy cohort in Western Australia for which 2,900 pregnant women were recruited between 1989 and 1991 at King Edward Memorial Hospital, Perth, and nearby private clinics, with the mothers (Generation 1) and their 2,868 offspring (Generation 2) followed from 18 weeks&apos; gestation through childhood and adolescence into adulthood, to study how early life shapes later health and behaviour.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RAINE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Raine</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TRS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>The Raine Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Western Australian Pregnancy Cohort (Raine) Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Western Australian Pregnancy Cohort Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Raine Study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000538"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90244092</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Multi-ancestry genome-wide association analyses improve resolution of genes and pathways influencing lung function and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease risk.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:36914875</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10011137/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Next, we meta-analyzed two EUR-ancestry children’s cohorts—ALSPAC and Raine Study (age, 13–15 yr, n = 6,070)—to obtain effect estimates in children at the new lead SNPs.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
