        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90102434</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial population of 5,804 men and women aged 70 to 82 with pre-existing vascular disease or risk factors for it, screened in Scotland, Ireland and the Netherlands and randomised to pravastatin 40 mg/day or placebo for about 3.2 years to test whether statin treatment reduces coronary and cerebrovascular events in the elderly.</obo:IAO_0000115>
