        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90502765</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international registry and cohort, funded by the US National Cancer Institute and begun in 1997, of colorectal cancer cases, their unaffected relatives and population-based controls recruited through six centres in Australasia and North America (the Australasian, Mayo Clinic, Ontario, Seattle, University of Hawaii and USC Consortium registries), as a resource for research on familial and sporadic colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCFR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CCFR-II</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
