        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90102513</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Dutch population-based cohort of 8,592 residents of the city of Groningen aged 28 to 75, enrolled in 1997-1998 from 40,856 respondents who sent a morning urine sample, enriched for people with urinary albumin of at least 10 mg/L plus a random control sample, and followed up to study renal and cardiovascular disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PREVEND</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Prevention of REnal and Vascular ENd-stage Disease</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
