    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000556"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Germany"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5946295/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The study population for this analysis included patients diagnosed with CRC and recruited in the DACHS study (Darmkrebs: Chancen der Verhütung durch Screening), an ongoing multi-center population-based case-control study with additional active follow-up of cases conducted in the Rhine-Neckar region in the South of Germany.</rdfs:comment>
