        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90271557</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A UK resource of white European families with severe essential hypertension, collected by the Medical Research Council British Genetics of Hypertension (BRIGHT) study through the MRC General Practice Framework and other primary care practices (about 1,600 families with more than 2,000 affected sibling pairs, plus parent-offspring trios), with about 2,000 normotensive controls matched by age, sex and geography across the UK, for linkage and association studies of the genetics of hypertension.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BRIGHT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MRC British Genetics of Hypertension study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
