    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000870"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000874"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000936"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001567"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001571"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90455518</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium established in 2004 by research groups leading large molecular epidemiology studies of lung cancer, which pools data from its member case-control and cohort studies to study lung cancer risk and prognosis; its OncoArray project genotyped about 36,000 participants of European descent.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ILCCO</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>INTEGRAL-ILCCO</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Lung Cancer Consortium (Lung cancer OncoArray project)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>OncoArray Project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">International Lung Cancer Consortium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90455518</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Multi-ancestry GWAS meta-analyses of lung cancer reveal susceptibility loci and elucidate smoking-independent genetic risk.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39366959</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11452618/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>followed by a meta-analysis with the EA International Lung Cancer Consortium OncoArray study (ILCCO)7, for a total of 39,781 cases and 119,158 controls</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium established in 2004 by research groups leading large molecular epidemiology studies of lung cancer, which pools data from its member case-control and cohort studies to study lung cancer risk and prognosis; its OncoArray project genotyped about 36,000 participants of European descent.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3002160/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5619832/fullTextXML</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>ILCCO</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>INTEGRAL-ILCCO</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000870"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8815061/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The INTEGRAL-ILCCO project includes a total of 1,059 lung cancer cases and 899 controls from four sites: Harvard School of Public Health (HSPH), International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC), University of Liverpool, and Mount Sinai Hospital and Princess Margaret Hospital in Toronto (Supplementary Table S1; ref. 17).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000874"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9402242/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The imputed genotypes (reference panel: HRC r1.1) from 46,783 individuals from INTEGRAL (Integrative Analysis of Lung Cancer Etiology and Risk)-ILCCO (International Lung Cancer Consortium) lung cancer consortium were analyzed in this study. The subjects came from 9 independent studies: the OncoArray Consortium Lung Study (OncoArray), including 16,845 lung cancer cases and 13,057 controls, was used as the discovery. Individuals from another 8 smaller independent studies: Affymetrix Axiom Array Study (AFFY), the Genetic Epidemiology of Lung Cancer (GELCC) Consortium, the Environment and Genetics in Lung cancer Etiology study (EAGLE), the International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC), MD Anderson Cancer Center Study (MDACC)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000936"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8815061/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The INTEGRAL-ILCCO project includes a total of 1,059 lung cancer cases and 899 controls from four sites: Harvard School of Public Health (HSPH), International Agency for Research on Cancer (IARC), University of Liverpool, and Mount Sinai Hospital and Princess Margaret Hospital in Toronto (Supplementary Table S1; ref. 17).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001567"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5560148/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In 2010 the CAPUA Study was included in the ILCCO (International Lung Cancer Consortium, http://ilcco.iarc.fr) and SYNERGY group (http://SYNERGY.iarc.fr) from the International Agency for Research on Cancer 29, 30.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000560"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001571"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5824613/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Four ILCCO studies are included in this pooled analysis. The collaborating cohorts have been described in detail previously [45–51]. These are the Carotene and Retinol Efficacy Trial (CARET), European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition Study (EPIC), Shanghai Cohort Study (SCS), and Singapore Chinese Health Study (SCHS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000561 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000561">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <coho:hasCohort rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000011"/>
