        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90837544</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population genomics study launched in 2019 by Intermountain Healthcare (Utah) in partnership with deCODE genetics and Amgen, aiming to enrol up to 500,000 adult patients (more than 170,000 by 2023) whose whole-genome sequence or genotype data are linked to health records, to discover genetic biomarkers of disease and return actionable findings to participants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HerediGene</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HerediGene study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
