        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12807872/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>HerediGene is a population study, a large-scale collaboration between Intermountain Healthcare, deCODE genetics and Amgen.</rdfs:comment>
