        <rdfs:comment>At baseline, 3187 European-ancestry and African American adults aged 45 years or older (35% men; 32% African American; mean age 61±10 years) were recruited from six townships in Johnston County, North Carolina, and completed a clinical examination visit during 1991– 1997.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000567 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000567">
