        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of 2,762 women from Korea, Vietnam, Thailand and Indonesia, established by Korean researchers with measurements of 26 skin traits, skin-related surveys and whole-genome sequencing-based genotyping, to study the genetic and non-genetic determinants of skin traits and their variation across Asian countries.</obo:IAO_0000115>
