        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of colon cancer, with cases diagnosed in 1991–1994 and age- and sex-matched controls recruited from the Kaiser Permanente Medical Care Program of Northern California, Utah and the Twin Cities of Minnesota, extended in 1997–2001 by a parallel study of rectal cancer in Utah and Kaiser Permanente, collecting diet, physical activity and other lifestyle data to study their relation to colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
