        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90504004</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based prospective cohort of women born 1914–1948 living in Uppsala and Västmanland counties in central Sweden, established in 1987–1990 among the 90,303 women invited to mammography screening who completed a food frequency questionnaire, re-surveyed in 1997 and followed through linkage to Swedish national registers to study diet, lifestyle and chronic disease, notably cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SMC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Samsung</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
