        <rdfs:comment>Swedish Mammography Cohort and Cohort of Swedish Men: This work is supported by the Swedish Research Council/Infrastructure grant, the Swedish Cancer Foundation, and the Karolinska Institute&apos;s Distinguished Professor Award to Alicja Wolk.</rdfs:comment>
