        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based prospective cohort of women born 1914–1948 living in Uppsala and Västmanland counties in central Sweden, established in 1987–1990 among the 90,303 women invited to mammography screening who completed a food frequency questionnaire, re-surveyed in 1997 and followed through linkage to Swedish national registers to study diet, lifestyle and chronic disease, notably cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:42319504</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
