        <rdfs:comment>The Shanghai Men’s Health Study (SMHS) is an ongoing population-based cohort study of 61,480 Chinese men who were aged between 40 and 74 years, were free of cancer at enrollment, and lived in urban Shanghai, China; 45,766 (74.4%) provided a blood samples.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
