        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90104685</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A European multimodal biomarker dataset of 1,221 people aged over 50 with normal cognition, mild cognitive impairment or Alzheimer-type dementia and known amyloid status, whose existing clinical data, samples and scans were retrospectively combined from 11 prospective European cohort studies (three multicenter and eight single-center studies) within the Innovative Medicines Initiative-funded European Medical Information Framework, with plasma, cerebrospinal fluid, DNA and MRI data for discovery of diagnostic and prognostic Alzheimer disease biomarkers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EMIF</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EMIF-AD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EMIF-AD MBD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EMIF-AD Multimodal Biomarker Discovery study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>European Medical Information Framework</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">European Medical Information Framework for Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Multimodal Biomarker Discovery study</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000581"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90104685</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-Wide Association Study of Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Brain Imaging Biomarkers and Neuropsychological Phenotypes in the European Medical Information Framework for Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Multimodal Biomarker Discovery Dataset.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35386118</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A35386118+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Specifically, we utilized genotype and phenotype data from n = 931 individuals collected under the auspices of the European Medical Information Framework for Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Multimodal Biomarker Discovery (EMIF-AD MBD) study to perform a total of 19 separate GWAS analyses.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000581"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A European multimodal biomarker dataset of 1,221 people aged over 50 with normal cognition, mild cognitive impairment or Alzheimer-type dementia and known amyloid status, whose existing clinical data, samples and scans were retrospectively combined from 11 prospective European cohort studies (three multicenter and eight single-center studies) within the Innovative Medicines Initiative-funded European Medical Information Framework, with plasma, cerebrospinal fluid, DNA and MRI data for discovery of diagnostic and prognostic Alzheimer disease biomarkers.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:29980228</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
