        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Spanish colorectal cancer study combining two case-control studies: incident colorectal cancer cases and hospital controls recruited at the University Hospital of Bellvitge, L&apos;Hospitalet de Llobregat (Barcelona), in 1996–1998, and cases and population controls recruited at Bellvitge and the Hospital of León in 2007–2015, genotyped to study the genetics and genomics of colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Colorectal Cancer Genetics Study also denotes Colorectal Cancer Genetic Susceptibility Study (COHO:0001603); this term is Colorectal Cancer Genetics &amp; Genomics.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CRC Genetics Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CRCGEN</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
