        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.</obo:IAO_0000115>
