        <rdfs:comment>Swiss Cohort Study on Air Pollution And Lung And Heart Disease In Adults (SAPALDIA) is a population-based multi-center study in eight geographic areas representing the range of environmental, meteorological and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland (Ackermann-Liebrich et al., 1997; Martin et al., 1997).</rdfs:comment>
