        <rdfs:comment>Data were collected as part of the North Carolina Colon Cancer Study (NCCCS), a population-based, case–control study conducted in 33 contiguous counties of central and eastern North Carolina, including both rural and urban areas [17].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000598 -->

