        <obo:IAO_0000115>A corporate genome cohort of employees of Toshiba Corporation, a Japanese electronics company, whose health-care database for precision-medicine research holds genomic, health check-up, questionnaire and prescription data of consenting employees (over 11,600 of whom had given genetic samples by 2024), used for genetic studies such as of side effects after COVID-19 booster vaccination.</obo:IAO_0000115>
