        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium of genome-wide association studies of blood lipid levels that meta-analyses summary statistics from primary studies of several genetic ancestry groups (about 1.65 million individuals from 201 studies in its 2021 round) to find loci for LDL and HDL cholesterol, triglycerides and total cholesterol.</obo:IAO_0000115>
