        <rdfs:comment>We replicated 168 previously reported loci from the largest LDL-C GWAS by the Global Lipids Genetics Consortium (GLGC), with high correlation in allele frequencies (R2 = 0.77) and moderate correlation in effect sizes (Beta;</rdfs:comment>
