        <rdfs:comment>The Molecular Epidemiology of Colorectal Cancer Study (MECC) is a population-based study of incident CRC cases and healthy controls recruited from northern Israel from 1998 to 2017 [45].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


