        <obo:IAO_0000115>A sample of healthy controls of European American and African American ancestry recruited at the National Institute on Alcohol Abuse and Alcoholism, National Institutes of Health, USA, who did not meet criteria for alcohol dependence or other major psychiatric disorders on the Structured Clinical Interview for DSM-IV and gave blood samples used for genome-wide DNA methylation analysis and genotyping on Illumina OmniExpress arrays.</obo:IAO_0000115>
