        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90034520</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Deciphering osteoarthritis genetics across 826,690 individuals from 9 populations.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34450027</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8459317/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The GARP study is a prospective observational study in patients with familial generalized osteoarthritis, hand osteoarthritis and other osteoarthritis phenotypes.</rdfs:comment>
