        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of about 2,000 healthy, unrelated young adults of Irish ancestry aged 18–28, recruited at Trinity College Dublin, Ireland, in 2003–2004, with plasma and serum samples and genotypes used to study genetic influences on circulating metabolites.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym TSS also denotes US Cystic Fibrosis Twin and Sibling Study (COHO:0001158); this term is Trinity Student Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
