        <rdfs:comment>Samples were collected as part of the Trinity Student Study (TSS), in which a cohort of healthy young adults (aged 18–28 y) were recruited at Trinity College Dublin over a 1-y period (2003–2004), as described previously (36–38).</rdfs:comment>
