        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of 1982 adults aged 65 and over from southwestern Pennsylvania, USA, recruited by age-stratified random sampling from electoral rolls and followed with longitudinal cognitive assessments to study cognitive decline and dementia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
