        <obo:IAO_0000115>A single-centre Danish prospective clinical birth cohort (COPSAC2000) of 411 children born in 1998–2001 to mothers with asthma, enrolled at 1 month of age and followed closely at the COPSAC clinical research unit in Copenhagen through childhood and to age 18 to study genetic, environmental and lifestyle risk factors for asthma, atopic dermatitis, allergy and other chronic inflammatory disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym COPSAC also denotes Copenhagen Prospective Studies on Asthma in Childhood (COHO:0000944); this term is Copenhagen Prospective Study on Asthma in Childhood.</obo:IAO_0000116>
