        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Norwegian multi-centre network of clinical sites that pools Alzheimer&apos;s disease dementia and mild cognitive impairment cases from memory-clinic and other studies (among them NorCog, DemVest, the AHUS study, HUNT dementia studies, TrønderBrain and DDI), examined with standardized cognitive, functional and behavioural measures and followed for progression, together with cognitively normal and population controls, for genetic studies of Alzheimer&apos;s disease and dementia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DemGene</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
