        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A19734903+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To identify other risk loci, we conducted a large genome-wide association study of 2,032 individuals from France with Alzheimer&apos;s disease (cases) and 5,328 controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


