        <obo:IAO_0000115>A network, funded by the US National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke, that brought together ischaemic stroke case collections from genetic research centres in the United States, Europe and Australia, with stroke subtypes harmonised by the web-based Causative Classification of Stroke system, for genome-wide association studies of ischaemic stroke and its subtypes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
