        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10138356/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Here, we used the data from three sub-cohorts for which we had bacterial and viral infections disease data—Korčula (N = 2833), Vis (N = 1039) and Split (N = 1012).</rdfs:comment>
