        <rdfs:comment>Population-based families were recruited from the Greater San Francisco Bay area, California, USA, by the Northern California Cancer Center; from the province of Ontario, Canada, by Cancer Care Ontario; and from the metropolitan areas of Melbourne and Sydney, Australia, by the University of Melbourne and the New South Wales Cancer Council.</rdfs:comment>
