        <rdfs:comment>To further investigate the RPD risk haplotype and examine the clinical importance of the identified risk region, short-read whole genome sequencing (WGS) was conducted in a distinct AMD+ cohort (from the Centre for Eye Research Australia, CERA) of European ancestry and unrelated individuals with extreme RPD (AMD+/RPD++), defined as having extensive and predominantly RPD deposits.</rdfs:comment>
