        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Finnish–US study of type 2 diabetes genetics that ascertained Finnish families with type 2 diabetes in at least two siblings, with spouses and offspring examined by frequently sampled intravenous glucose tolerance tests, and later Finnish type 2 diabetes cases and normoglycaemic controls, to map susceptibility genes for type 2 diabetes and related quantitative traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>FUSION</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
