        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective population-based cohort of 30,239 African American and European American adults aged 45 or older recruited from the 48 contiguous US states and the District of Columbia in 2003–2007, designed to measure stroke incidence and its risk factors and to explain geographic and racial differences in stroke.</obo:IAO_0000115>
