        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0058-3/MediaObjects/41588_2018_58_MOESM1_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>For this project, ischemic stroke cases recruited from 15 sites throughout Germany and determined not to have Fabry Disease were included in the analysis.</rdfs:comment>
