        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nationally representative cohort of people in the United States born between 1976 and 1982, enrolled as adolescents and followed in repeated waves into adulthood with self-report, parent-report, geocoded and genetic data to study how adolescent circumstances shape later health and wellbeing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Add Health</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AddHealth</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
