        <rdfs:comment>Genotype and limited demographic data on otherwise healthy pediatric controls (n = 8,372) were obtained from the National Longitudinal Study of Adolescent to Adult Health (Add Health) cohort,35 which used 2 Illumina platforms for genotyping: the Illumina Human Omni1-Quad BeadChip for the majority of samples, and the Illumina Omni-2.5 Quad BeadChip.</rdfs:comment>
