        <rdfs:comment>A total of 4678 saliva samples were collected from children at schools all over Spain from different regions (Andalucía, Basque Country, Castilla-León, Murcia, and Canary Islands), after informed consent was obtained from their tutors or parents.</rdfs:comment>
