        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of people aged 30–75 years born in Iraq or Sweden and resident in Malmö, Sweden, randomly selected from the Malmö census register, to study the impact of migration and ethnicity on type 2 diabetes and related metabolic traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
