        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12461003/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Individuals with incident lung cancer and matched control subjects were selected based on self-identified Black/African American race from the prospective Southern Community Cohort Study (SCCS),15 the NCI Lung Cancer and Smoking Phenotypes in African American Cases and Controls (NCI) study,6,9 and INHALE16 for inclusion in the planned analysis.</rdfs:comment>
