        <rdfs:comment>The Sigma Project comprises four databases: DMS (Diabetes in Mexico Study), MCDS (Mexico City Diabetes Study), MEC (Multiethnic Cohort) and UIDS (UNAM/INCMNSZ Diabetes Study).</rdfs:comment>
