        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based birth cohort of the 5,914 live births in 1982 to families living in the urban area of Pelotas, a city in southern Brazil, followed through repeated interviews and a clinic visit at about age 30 covering mental health, body composition, precursors of chronic disease and human capital.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25733577</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
