        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9727532/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The DCCT was a multicenter randomized clinical trial, including 1441 volunteers (96%–97% Caucasian), aged 13 years to 39 years, with T1D of 1 year to 15 years duration from 29 medical centers in the United States and Canada conducted from 1983 to 1993</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000748 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000748">
