        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym EAGLE also denotes Environment And Genetics in Lung cancer Etiology study (COHO:0000749) and EArly Genetics and Lifecourse Epidemiology consortium (COHO:0000750); this term is EAGLE BioVU.</obo:IAO_0000116>
