        <owl:annotatedTarget>The participants of BioVU, the Vanderbilt University Medical Center biorepository, studied by the Epidemiologic Architecture for Genes Linked to Environment (EAGLE) site of the NHGRI Population Architecture using Genomics and Epidemiology (PAGE) program in trans-ethnic genetic studies of complex traits.</owl:annotatedTarget>
