        <rdfs:comment>The Elucidating Loci Involved in Prostate Cancer Susceptibility (ELLIPSE) consortium prostate cancer meta-analysis and genotypes (dbGaP Study Accession: phs001120.v1.p1) was accessed to analyze Affymetrix genotype calls for 91,644 male PrCa case/controls.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
