        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7614755/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Two of these studies included participants of Hispanic American ancestry (MACAD and HTN-IR; N ISI = 1095, N IFC = 1099) and 1 included participants of East Asian ancestry (TAICHI; N ISI = 730 N IFC = 739); the remaining 25 studies included individuals of European ancestry.</rdfs:comment>
