        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90245885</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A clinical trials network of more than 220 hospitals and more than 13,500 researchers, clinicians and specialists that designs and runs clinical trials and research studies to cure and prevent childhood and adolescent cancer; genetic studies use participants of its trials.</obo:IAO_0000115>
