        <rdfs:comment>The CORECT study meta-analysis was conducted using germline DNA the Molecular Epidemiology of Colorectal Cancer study (MECC) (set 1: 484 cases and 498 controls; set 2: 1,120 cases and 820 controls), CCFR (set 1: 1,977 cases and 999 controls; set 2: 1,660 cases and 1,393 controls), Kentucky case-control study (1,038 cases and 1,134 controls), Newfoundland case-control study (548 cases and 538 controls), American Cancer Society CPS II nested case-control study (ACS/CPSII, 539 cases and 469 controls) and the Melbourne nested case-control study (195 cases and 477 controls).</rdfs:comment>
