        <obo:IAO_0000115>A collaboration between the Regeneron Genetics Center and Geisinger Health System in which adult participants of Geisinger&apos;s MyCode Community Health Initiative are exome-sequenced and genotyped and linked to longitudinal electronic health records, for genomics-guided precision medicine and therapeutic discovery.</obo:IAO_0000115>
