        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Swedish population-based case-control study of multiple sclerosis in which incident cases were recruited from hospital-based and privately run neurology units and matched controls were randomly selected from the national population register, with questionnaires on environmental and lifestyle exposures and blood samples for genetic analyses.</obo:IAO_0000115>
