        <rdfs:comment>We used data from Epidemiological Investigation of Multiple Sclerosis (EIMS) and Genes and Environment in Multiple Sclerosis (GEMS), which are Swedish population-based, case-control studies.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


