        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre sample of healthy non-diabetic offspring of patients with type 2 diabetes, recruited in Denmark, Finland, Germany, Italy and Sweden by the European Network on Functional Genomics of Type 2 Diabetes and examined with glucose tolerance tests and hyperinsulinaemic euglycaemic clamps to study the genetics of insulin secretion and insulin sensitivity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
