        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of 33,346 residents of the city of Malmö in southern Sweden, recruited by pre-specified birth-year groups for health examinations from 1974 to 1992, whose samples and data are used in genetic and biomarker studies of disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
