        <rdfs:comment>The subjects consisted of participants from two longitudinal cohort studies operated out of The Rush Alzheimer’s Disease Center in Chicago, the Religious Order Study (ROS) and the Rush Memory and Aging Project (MAP).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
