        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium founded in 2011 of medical researchers and social scientists that coordinates genome-wide association studies of social-science outcomes such as educational attainment across more than 100 contributing cohorts and promotes harmonised phenotype measurement.</obo:IAO_0000115>
