        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90302935</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A European population-based exposome cohort built across six existing longitudinal birth cohorts in France, Greece, Lithuania, Norway, Spain and the UK, with a subcohort of 1,301 mother-child pairs in which biomarkers, omics signatures and child health outcomes were measured at age 6–11 years, to relate multiple early-life environmental exposures to molecular signatures and child health.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym HELIX also denotes Helix Exome+ and Healthy Nevada Project COVID-19 Phenotypes (COHO:0000828); this term is Human Early Life Exposome.</obo:IAO_0000116>
