        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000829"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001079"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5379621/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Because 865 MARTHA/EOVT participants examined in the current study also took part in the INVENT study, we were able to calculate the Spearman correlation between the true rs121918472 genotype as provided by Illumina Exome array results, and the imputed dose-derived from GWAS arrays.</rdfs:comment>
