        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based case-control study of bladder cancer among residents of Maine, New Hampshire and Vermont, United States, with cases newly diagnosed in 2001–2004 and population controls frequency-matched on age, sex and state, used to study environmental, dietary and genetic risk factors for bladder cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEBCS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEBCS-ME/VT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NEBCS-NH</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
