        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based incidence cohort of people diagnosed with Parkinson&apos;s disease within the previous 3.5 years, recruited by the Oxford Parkinson&apos;s Disease Centre from 11 hospitals across the Thames Valley, England, between 2010 and 2014, and followed with motor, cognitive and non-motor assessments to study Parkinson&apos;s disease progression and subtypes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
