        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Spanish case-control study of venous thromboembolism, based at the Hospital de la Santa Creu i Sant Pau in Barcelona, whose cases had a first venous thromboembolism and were sampled after 6–12 months of anticoagulant treatment, with healthy controls recruited from the general population, used to study genetic and plasma determinants of venous thromboembolism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
