        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90297562</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium of lung cancer studies of never-smoking Asian women from mainland China, Hong Kong, Singapore, Taiwan, South Korea and Japan, pooling genome-wide data to identify genetic risk factors for lung cancer, particularly adenocarcinoma, in this population.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>FLCCA</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000864"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90297562</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association study of lung adenocarcinoma in East Asia and comparison with a European population.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:37236969</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10220065/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the current study, we conducted a two-stage GWAS meta-analysis in EA populations using unpublished and previously published data from four studies: the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia (FLCCA), Nanjing Lung Cancer Study (NJLCS)10,24, National Cancer Center Research Institute (NCC) and Aichi Cancer Center (ACC), with 11,753 cases and 30,562 controls in the discovery set and 9905 cases and 120,114 controls in the replication set.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000864"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium of lung cancer studies of never-smoking Asian women from mainland China, Hong Kong, Singapore, Taiwan, South Korea and Japan, pooling genome-wide data to identify genetic risk factors for lung cancer, particularly adenocarcinoma, in this population.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:42152146</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000864"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>FLCCA</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000864"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001562"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>These studies include the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences Cancer Hospital Study (CAMSCH)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000864"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/hasCohort"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001600"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Additional studies included in this GWAS are the Guangdong Study (GDS), the Hong Kong Study (HKS), the Japanese Female Lung Cancer Collaborative Study (JLCS)14 , the Chonnam National University Lung Cancer Study (CNULCS) Study15 , and the Yunnan Lung Cancer Study (YLCS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000864"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Japan"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13348699/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>FLCCA is an international consortium focusing on never-smoking Asian women, with participating studies from Mainland China, Hong Kong, Singapore, Taiwan, South Korea, and Japan.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


