        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90278188</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of patients with hidradenitis suppurativa recruited at the University of North Carolina Department of Dermatology in the United States from August 2018 (753 patients by July 2021, later expanded to 986), providing clinical data and DNA for genetic association studies of the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HS ProCARE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Hidradenitis Suppurativa Program for Research and Care Excellence</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
