        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90310275</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multi-centre European population-based cohort of 16,228 children aged 2 to 9 years examined in 2007–2008 in Belgium, Cyprus, Estonia, Germany, Hungary, Italy, Spain and Sweden, with a community-based obesity-prevention intervention, followed into adolescence by the I.Family study to identify dietary and lifestyle risk factors for childhood overweight and metabolic disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
