        <rdfs:comment>The European IDEFICS (Identification and prevention of Dietary- and lifestyle-induced health EFfects In Children and infantS)/I.Family cohort is a multi-centre population-based children’s study that aimed to identify risk factors for diet- and lifestyle-related diseases, with a focus on childhood overweight and metabolic disorders [14, 15].</rdfs:comment>
