        <rdfs:comment>The Philadelphia Neurodevelopmental Cohort (PNC) is a population-based study of youth living in the greater Philadelphia (United States) area (Calkins et al., 2015) that aims to describe how genetics impacts brain development and cognitive functioning in adolescents (Satterthwaite et al., 2014).</rdfs:comment>
