        <obo:IAO_0000115>An observational multicentre study in the United States of physician-diagnosed diabetes in people under 20 years old, ascertaining prevalent and incident cases in geographically defined populations and health plans, with interviews, examinations and laboratory measurements, to estimate the prevalence, incidence and classification of diabetes in youth.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym SEARCH also denotes Study of Epidemiology and Risk Factors in Cancer Heredity (COHO:0000881); this term is SEARCH for Diabetes in Youth.</obo:IAO_0000116>
