        <rdfs:comment>The genetic role of sex on asthma susceptibility was assessed in the Genes-environments &amp; Admixture in Latino Americans (GALA II) and the Study of African Americans, Asthma, Genes, and Environments (SAGE) studies [22].</rdfs:comment>
