        <rdfs:comment>Socio-demographic data, infection history, and cognitive performance data were collected from 5059 consented participants (male (n = 2345) and female (n = 2714)) aged 40 years and older recruited from Bushbuckridge, Mpumalanga (November 2014 to November 2015) and a sub-set of 2246 of these participants (male (n = 935) and female (n = 1311)) had genotype data.</rdfs:comment>
