        <obo:IAO_0000115>A health and socio-demographic surveillance system of about 90,000 people in rural northeast South Africa close to the Mozambique border, established in 1992, which updates resident status and vital events annually and hosts observational cohorts and trials across the life course on health, population and social transitions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
