        <owl:annotatedTarget>A large international consortium established to identify glaucoma risk genes through large-scale genome-wide meta-analysis of primary open-angle glaucoma and related traits such as intraocular pressure, vertical cup-to-disc ratio and central corneal thickness, across populations of European, Asian and African ancestry.</owl:annotatedTarget>
