        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10393222/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We additionally used a binary definition of HIV spontaneous control in the subset of samples obtained from the International HIV Controllers Study and the AIDS Clinical Trials Group (Supplemental Table 1) (17).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
