        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11449136/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>IMSE is an ongoing phase IV clinical trial that monitors long-term safety and risk of immunomodulatory treatments for MS.</rdfs:comment>
