        <owl:annotatedTarget>A set of Swedish post-marketing (phase IV) cohorts of patients with multiple sclerosis treated with novel disease-modifying drugs, followed through the Swedish MS registry to monitor the long-term safety and risks of immunomodulatory treatments.</owl:annotatedTarget>
