        <rdfs:comment>Descriptive statistics include age at sampling, sex (male:female), distribution of Epstein-Barr virus (EBV) serology and infectious mononucleosis (IM) history stratified by multiple sclerosis (MS) cases and population-matched controls from four Swedish cohorts (GEMS, EIMS, IMSE, and STOP-MS).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
