    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000938"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Japan"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10816704/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 175,672 individuals were included in this GWAS meta-analysis of six Japanese cohorts, namely, the Hospital-based Epidemiologic Research Program at Aichi Cancer Center (HERPACC) Study (n = 4958) (25), the Japan Multi-Institutional Collaborative Cohort (J-MICC) Study (n = 13,236) (26, 27), the Japan Public Health Center-based Prospective (JPHC) Study (n = 10,037) (28), the Tohoku Medical Megabank Community-Based Cohort (TMM) Study (n = 7857) (29), the Nagahama Prospective Cohort for Comprehensive Human Bioscience (Nagahama) Study (n = 4591) (30), and the BioBank Japan (BBJ) Study (n = 134,993) (31, 32) after imputation and quality control (QC) of individual subject genotype data (Supplementary Materials and tables S1 and S2).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


