        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym TMM also denotes Tohoku Medical Megabank Project (COHO:0000533) and Tohoku Medical Megabank Community-Based Cohort Study (COHO:0000938); this term is Tohoku Medical Megabank Project Birth and Three-Generation Cohort Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
