        <rdfs:comment>COPSAC2010 is a mother child cohort comprising 700 children born to unselected mothers from Denmark as described previously in detail9,10 .</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000945 -->

