        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium of epidemiological cohorts from Europe, the United States and Japan with detailed clinical information on dental diseases, within which genome-wide association studies of dental caries and periodontitis are conducted and meta-analysed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GLIDE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Gene-Lifestyle Interactions and Dental Endpoints</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
