    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000948"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A41549403+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We compared neuroimaging and cognitive profiles between cognitively unimpaired older Latino and non-Latino adults from the greater Boston area.MethodsTwenty Latino and 230 non-Latino cognitively unimpaired older adults from the Harvard Aging Brain Study were included.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


