        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort study of osteoporosis and fracture in Southern Chinese women and men recruited from the community in Hong Kong between 1995 and 2010, with questionnaire, anthropometric and clinical assessments at baseline and long-term follow-up through linkage to the Hong Kong Hospital Authority&apos;s territory-wide electronic health records.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>HKOS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
