        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control sample for genome-wide association studies of ischaemic stroke and its subtypes, comprising stroke patients of European ancestry admitted to four clinical centres in Australia (Gosford Hospital, John Hunter Hospital in Newcastle, The Queen Elizabeth Hospital in Adelaide and Royal Perth Hospital) between 2003 and 2008, and population controls from the Hunter Community Study.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22941190</obo:IAO_0000119>
