        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9007944/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The CECILE study was supported by Fondation de France, Institut National du Cancer (INCa), Ligue Nationale contre le Cancer, Agence Nationale de Sécurité Sanitaire, de l&apos;Alimentation, de l&apos;Environnement et du Travail (ANSES), Agence Nationale de la Recherche (ANR).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000960"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based case-control study of breast cancer in two French départements, Côte d&apos;Or and Ille-et-Vilaine, in which women under 75 years of age with invasive or in situ breast carcinoma diagnosed from April 2005 to March 2007 and population controls frequency-matched to them by age, recruited over the same period, were interviewed in person by trained nurses, most also giving a blood sample; it has been used to study occupational, environmental and genetic risk factors for breast cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
