        <obo:IAO_0000115>A Finnish collection of people with type 1 diabetes, most of them diagnosed in childhood, together with members of their families, which has contributed cases, controls and parent–offspring trios to international genetic studies of type 1 diabetes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
