        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S0006322321015705-mmc1.pdf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Janssen lifetime suicide attempt cohort consisted of subjects of European ancestry and was drawn from multiple clinical trial samples (NCT00044681, NCT00397033, NCT00412373, NCT00334126, NCT01193153, NCT00094926) conducted by Janssen Research &amp; Development, LLC</rdfs:comment>
