        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective cohort of adults at high risk of cardiovascular disease, enrolled from November 2013 at Severance Hospital in Seoul, South Korea, to develop preventive strategies for high-risk patients. Participants qualify through high-risk hypertension, diabetes with albuminuria, end-stage renal disease on dialysis, asymptomatic atherosclerotic disease, rheumatoid arthritis treated with methotrexate and steroids, atrial fibrillation, a kidney transplant, or being a relative of a patient with early acute myocardial infarction.</owl:annotatedTarget>
