        <rdfs:comment>A total of 569 newly diagnosed individuals with T1D were available from three sub-cohorts, all part of The Danish Childhood Diabetes Register (DanDiabKids), described elsewhere [26,27,28].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000983 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000983">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90624054</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A group of three randomised trials of supervised exercise training, STRRIDE I (1999–2003), STRRIDE AT/RT (2004–2008) and STRRIDE-PD (2009–2012), that enrolled previously sedentary adults with overweight or obesity and mild-to-moderate dyslipidaemia or prediabetes at Duke University Medical Center and East Carolina University, to study the effects of exercise amount, mode and intensity, and of weight loss by caloric restriction, on cardiometabolic health.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>STRRIDE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Studies of a targeted risk reduction intervention through defined exercise</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Studies of a Targeted Risk Reduction Intervention through Defined Exercise</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000983"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90624054</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-Wide Genetic Analysis of Dropout in a Controlled Exercise Intervention in Sedentary Adults With Overweight or Obesity and Cardiometabolic Disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38489667</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11008589/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Therefore, in this report, we undertook a genome-wide association study (GWAS) approach to identify other putative genetic variants associated with dropout from exercise training interventions among 603 individuals in the STRRIDE (Studies of a Targeted Risk Reduction Intervention through Defined Exercise) randomized trials.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000983"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A group of three randomised trials of supervised exercise training, STRRIDE I (1999–2003), STRRIDE AT/RT (2004–2008) and STRRIDE-PD (2009–2012), that enrolled previously sedentary adults with overweight or obesity and mild-to-moderate dyslipidaemia or prediabetes at Duke University Medical Center and East Carolina University, to study the effects of exercise amount, mode and intensity, and of weight loss by caloric restriction, on cardiometabolic health.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:37492634</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000983"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>STRRIDE</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000983"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10364164/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Participants were enrolled at either Duke University Medical Center or East Carolina University (ECU).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000984 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000984">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000001"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Asia"/>
