        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13083253/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Control cohorts included 7,323 samples from the National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute (NHLBI) TOPMed research program52, 49,981 samples from the UK Biobank44 and 18,232 samples across seven cohorts from dbGAP53.</rdfs:comment>
