        <obo:IAO_0000115>A subgroup of the PanCareLIFE ototoxicity genetics study made up of patients diagnosed with cancer before age 18 who were treated with upfront cisplatin and had no radiotherapy to the brain or inner ear, recruited in 2015–2017 through data providers in Switzerland, Italy, the Czech Republic, Denmark, Germany, Austria and the Netherlands for a genome-wide association study of cisplatin-induced hearing loss.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PCL WP4b</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
