        <rdfs:comment>The discovery cohort (PCL discovery cohort, D) consists of childhood cancer patients from the PCL consortium, a multicenter cohort of childhood cancer patients and survivors across Europe designed to address ototoxicity, fertility impairment, and quality of life.</rdfs:comment>
