        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A consortium of nine epidemiological studies of breast cancer in the United States, mostly population-based case-control studies, whose African American cases and controls were genotyped together for a genome-wide association study of breast cancer in women of African ancestry.</owl:annotatedTarget>
