        <rdfs:comment>This study examined how traumatic brain injury and post-traumatic stress disorder relate to cognitive function and neuroimaging markers in U.S. veterans from the Department of Defense Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Neuroimaging Initiative (ADNI-DOD).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000992"/>
