        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90267548</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international collaboration, sponsored by the Klarman Family Foundation and the US National Institute of Mental Health, that recruited individuals with a lifetime history of anorexia nervosa and controls in the United States, Australia, New Zealand, Sweden and Denmark, through treatment centres, national registers and traditional and social media, with blood samples and an online eating-disorder questionnaire, to rapidly expand the samples available for genome-wide association studies of anorexia nervosa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ANGI</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Anorexia Nervosa Genetics Initiative</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
