        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective multicentre cohort of clinically stable adult outpatients with chronic heart failure, enrolled from 2011 at Erasmus MC, Rotterdam, and Northwest Clinics, Alkmaar, the Netherlands, and seen every three months for blood sampling and clinical assessment, with echocardiography in a subset, to assess whether serial measurements of biomarkers can track disease progression and predict prognosis in individual patients.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Bio-SHIFT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Bio-SHiFT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
