        <rdfs:comment>Bio-SHiFT (Serial Biomarker Measurements and New Echocardiographic Techniques in chronic Heart Failure Patients Result in Tailored Prediction of Prognosis) is a prospective, observational study of stable patients with chronic heart failure (CHF).</rdfs:comment>
