        <owl:annotatedTarget>A province-wide biobank and prospective cohort in Québec, Canada, launched in March 2020 by the Fonds de recherche du Québec–Santé and Génome Québec, which recruits through a network of Québec hospitals adults and children with PCR-confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection, both hospitalised and non-hospitalised, and PCR-negative controls, with longitudinal biosamples and clinical data, to study the clinical and biological determinants of COVID-19 clinical trajectories.</owl:annotatedTarget>
