        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multisite case-control study of reading disability (developmental dyslexia) in Hispanic American and African American children aged 8 to 15, led by Yale University at sites in the United States, Puerto Rico and Canada, in which the children were assessed with reading and reading-related measures and gave DNA for genetic studies of reading ability and dyslexia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GRaD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Genes, Reading and Dyslexia</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
