        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9436320/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Most cohorts mainly include participants of European ancestry, with the exception of the GRaD cohort, which consists of individuals of African-American and Hispanic ancestry, and the ABCD Study, GenR and PING cohort, which include multiple ancestries.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
