        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST010723</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium of 26 studies of age-related macular degeneration, mainly in the United States, Europe, Israel and Australia, which gathered DNA from advanced and intermediate AMD cases, mostly recruited from ophthalmology clinics, and from controls, predominantly of European ancestry. The samples were genotyped centrally at the Center for Inherited Disease Research on a custom-modified HumanCoreExome array to examine common and rare genetic variants in AMD.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IAMDGC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International AMD genomics consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Age-Related Macular Degeneration Genomics Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Age-related Macular Degeneration Genomics Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">International AMD Genomics Consortium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001016"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST010723</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-wide association meta-analysis for early age-related macular degeneration highlights novel loci and insights for advanced disease.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:32843070</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A32843070+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>To identify genetic factors for early AMD, we conducted a genome-wide association study (GWAS) meta-analysis (14,034 cases, 91,214 controls, 11 sources of data including the International AMD Genomics Consortium, IAMDGC, and UK Biobank, UKBB).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001016"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium of 26 studies of age-related macular degeneration, mainly in the United States, Europe, Israel and Australia, which gathered DNA from advanced and intermediate AMD cases, mostly recruited from ophthalmology clinics, and from controls, predominantly of European ancestry. The samples were genotyped centrally at the Center for Inherited Disease Research on a custom-modified HumanCoreExome array to examine common and rare genetic variants in AMD.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26691988</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
