        <obo:IAO_0000115>A single-centre prospective observational cohort of Japanese patients with rheumatoid arthritis, established in October 2000 at the Institute of Rheumatology, Tokyo Women&apos;s Medical University, Tokyo, which registers consenting patients with rheumatoid arthritis treated at the institute and collects patient questionnaires, physician assessments of disease activity and laboratory data twice a year, in April and October.</obo:IAO_0000115>
