        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium that meta-analyses genome-wide association data on suicide attempt and suicide death from cohorts worldwide, including cohorts ascertained for psychiatric disorders or substance use, studies of suicide or suicide attempt, and population-based biobanks, to identify genetic risk loci for suicidal behaviour and separate them from those of psychiatric disorders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ISGC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Suicide Genomics Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
