        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://gut.bmj.com/content/gutjnl/early/2026/07/01/gutjnl-2026-338800/DC1/embed/inline-supplementary-material-1.pdf?download=true</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Genomic Health Initiative (GHI) is a community-based healthcare biobank established at Endeavor Health (Evanston, Illinois, USA), designed to integrate genomic data with comprehensive EHR.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
