        <obo:IAO_0000115>A research biobank of the Royal Brompton and Harefield hospitals in London, United Kingdom, which since 2009 has collected blood and other samples, including cardiac tissue, with clinical, imaging and follow-up data from adult and paediatric patients attending the hospitals for the investigation or treatment of cardiovascular conditions, and from their relatives, to find genes and biomarkers for the diagnosis and prognosis of cardiovascular disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Cardiovascular Research Centre Biobank, Royal Brompton &amp; Harefield NHS Foundation Trust</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RBH Biobank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>RBH-CRB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
