        <dcterms:title>Large-scale genome-wide association analyses identify novel genetic loci and mechanisms in hypertrophic cardiomyopathy.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39966646</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
