        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90132135</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled phase II trial sponsored by Hoffmann-La Roche and run from 2007 to 2010 at sites in Europe, Israel, South Africa and the United States, in which ex-smokers over 44 years old with smoking-related moderate to severe COPD with emphysema, on optimised COPD therapy, were assigned to the gamma-selective retinoid agonist palovarotene or placebo.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TESRA</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Treatment Of Emphysema With A Selective Retinoid Agonist</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
