        <rdfs:comment>Among the Hispanic cohorts, sample sizes ranged from 130 (TRIPOD) to 251 10,065 (SOL) with a minimum imputation score of r2=0.69 and Phet=0.43. 252 20 253 Supplementary Figure 33.Forest plot of FI-associated variant rs13258890.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
