        <obo:IAO_0000115>A host genetics study of COVID-19 in Mexico, run under the ethics approval of the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición Salvador Zubirán (INCMNSZ) in Mexico City, of genotyped COVID-19 cases and controls of admixed American ancestry who were also asked about long COVID symptoms by telephone questionnaire.</obo:IAO_0000115>
