        <rdfs:comment>In contrast to the diverse AoU American study cohort, the Sano GOLD study cohort was comprised of British patients of predominantly white European ancestry (&gt; 91% of the cohort), with Asian ancestry (~ 4%) as the largest non-white European demographic.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


