        <obo:IAO_0000115>A biobank of patients hospitalised with COVID-19 at the University Hospital of Ioannina, Greece, genotyped for host genetic studies of COVID-19 and long COVID, with population controls drawn from the Epirus Health Study cohort.</obo:IAO_0000115>
