        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90129505</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium, initiated in 2010, that pools genome-wide genotype data on colorectal cancer cases and cancer-free controls of East Asian ancestry from studies in China, Japan and South Korea, among them the Shanghai Women&apos;s and Men&apos;s Health Studies and colorectal cancer studies from Shanghai, Guangzhou, Aichi, BioBank Japan and several Korean centres, to identify genetic risk factors for colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ACCC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
