        <rdfs:comment>Recruitment and sequencing of participants from the Columbia COVID-19 Biobank were approved by the Columbia University Institutional Review Board (IRB) protocol AAAS7370 and the genetic analyses were approved under protocol AAAS7948.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
