        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based study of stroke incidence, risk factors, treatment and outcomes in the biracial population of a five-county region of southwestern Ohio and northern Kentucky, United States, around Cincinnati, which ascertains all hospitalized and autopsied strokes and transient ischaemic attacks among residents during one-year study periods held since 1993 (July 1993 to June 1994, 1999, 2005, 2010 and 2015), to measure temporal trends in stroke incidence and outcome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GCNKSS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Greater Cincinnati Northern Kentucky Stroke Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
