        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90444397</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Participants of the COVID-19 genetic studies of the Russian genetic testing company Genotek: its customers who consented to research use of their data and answered online questionnaires about COVID-19, studied for long COVID and, when aged 40 or over with non-severe COVID-19, as controls in a genome-wide association study of severe COVID-19 whose cases were patients hospitalised in Moscow and Ufa.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Genotek</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
