        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90054778</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A combined sample of two longitudinal family studies of the Institute for Behavioral Genetics at the University of Colorado Boulder, United States: the Colorado Adoption Project, a prospective adoption study of behavioural development begun in 1975, and the Colorado Twin Registry, a population-based registry of twins born since 1968 that has recruited since 1982. Their genotyped participants are analysed together in genome-wide association meta-analyses of childhood and adolescent psychiatric traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>IBG</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
