        <obo:IAO_0000115>A research resource of epidemiological, family-history, lifestyle and clinical data and biospecimens collected since 1997 from affected and unaffected members of families with multiple cases of breast and/or ovarian cancer, recruited by research nurses through family cancer clinics in Australia and New Zealand, and made available to researchers anywhere in the world for studies of familial breast cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
