        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001101"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>MCS</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001101"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Singapore"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12588707/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Harmonization study is an ongoing prospective study which recruited patients from memory clinics of the National University Hospital and St. Luke’s Hospital in Singapore, aiming to examine cognitive deterioration and associated biomarkers in older Asian individuals with cognitive impairment and dementia due to AD and/or cerebrovascular disease (CeVD).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001102 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001102">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Northern_America"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90301368</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based study at the Massachusetts General Hospital in Boston, United States, that from 2003 enrolled adults with acute ischaemic stroke (consecutive patients admitted to its stroke unit through the emergency department, or seen in its neurology clinics or on other inpatient services), with stroke-free controls from the hospital&apos;s outpatient clinics matched on age, sex and ancestry, to study genetic influences on the risk and outcome of ischaemic stroke; one of the genetic research centres of the Stroke Genetics Network.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>GASROS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Genes Affecting Stroke Risk and Outcomes Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
