        <rdfs:comment>Secondly, the EUGENDA cohort enrolled individuals from 55 years of age, while some other cohorts enrolled older individuals only (e.g. Montrachet ≥75 years, Alienor ≥77 years).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
