        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90301368</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based collection of consecutive patients of European ancestry with ischaemic stroke, recruited from 2002 to 2009 at the dedicated stroke unit of the Department of Neurology, Klinikum Großhadern, Ludwig-Maximilians-University, Munich, Germany, with stroke subtypes assigned by TOAST criteria; the cases were genotyped genome-wide in the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium 2 ischaemic stroke study and contribute to METASTROKE, the Stroke Genetics Network (SiGN) and MEGASTROKE.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MUNICH</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MUNICH study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
