        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90482691</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control sample of Chinese patients with histologically confirmed incident non-small cell lung cancer, untreated by chemotherapy or radiotherapy before diagnosis, and cancer-free controls from community screening for non-communicable diseases, frequency-matched on age, sex and region, genotyped on the Illumina Global Screening Array by Nanjing Medical University, China; it combines three regional case-control studies, from Nanjing and Shanghai, from Beijing and Tianjin, and from Guangdong.</obo:IAO_0000115>
