        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST005843</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genetic epidemiological study of type 2 diabetes and cardiovascular disease in Punjabi-speaking Sikhs of North Indian origin, begun as a family-based study of Khatri Sikh families with at least two siblings affected by type 2 diabetes and extended as a case-control study, with participants recruited in northern India from 2003, to investigate genetic and environmental risk factors for type 2 diabetes and cardiovascular disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym AIDHS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym AIDHS/SDS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym SDS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym SiDS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Khatri Sikh Diabetes Study also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Sikh Diabetes Study also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study (COHO:0001141); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
