        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90267392</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A two-phase case-control study of colorectal polyps among enrollees of Group Health Cooperative (now Kaiser Permanente Washington), an integrated health-care delivery system in western Washington State, United States, aged 24–79 years who had an index colonoscopy for any indication in 1998–2003 or 2004–2007, comprising patients diagnosed with adenomas or serrated polyps and polyp-free controls who gave buccal-cell or blood samples and completed a structured questionnaire; its advanced-adenoma cases and matched polyp-free controls were genotyped for consortium genome-wide studies of colorectal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SMS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SMS AD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
