        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>EBI MERGE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Genome-wide association scan in Parkinson&apos;s disease</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
