        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC8601399/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The PD cohorts include the International PD Genomics Consortium (IPDGC) NeuroX dataset, the National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke (NINDS) PD dataset, the Autopsy-Confirmed PD GWAS Consortium (APDGC) dataset genotyped by the Center for Inherited Disease Research, the NeuroGenetics Research Consortium (NGRC) dataset, the UK PD Consortium, and the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium 2, referred to here as EBI MERGE.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
