        <owl:annotatedTarget>The Parkinson&apos;s disease genome-wide case-control study of the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium 2 and the UK Parkinson&apos;s Disease Consortium: UK patients with idiopathic Parkinson&apos;s disease meeting UK Brain Bank criteria, randomly selected from population- and hospital-based clinics through five UK centres and genotyped at the Wellcome Trust Sanger Institute, compared with the WTCCC2 controls from the 1958 British Birth Cohort and the UK Blood Services.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21044948</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
