        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11612227/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The US control dataset (n = 4680) was collected previously and included samples from the 3D Facial Norms cohort and studies at the Pennsylvania State University and Indiana University-Purdue University Indianapolis.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
