        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90449062</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genetic epidemiological study of type 2 diabetes and its cardiovascular and metabolic risk factors in Punjabi Sikhs of northern India, also called the Sikh Diabetes Study. From 2003 to 2009 it recruited Khatri Sikh families with at least two siblings affected by type 2 diabetes (phase I) and unrelated type 2 diabetes cases and controls from the same area of Punjab (phase II).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym AIDHS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym AIDHS/SDS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym SDS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym SiDS also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Asian Indian diabetic heart study also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Khatri Sikh Diabetes Study also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The name Sikh Diabetes Study also denotes Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study/Sikh Diabetes Study (COHO:0001116); this term is Asian Indian Diabetic Heart Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AIDHS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
