        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90568440</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective cohort of children aged 7–10 years in grades 2 to 4 at 39 primary schools in Barcelona, Spain, selected as pairs with high and low traffic-related air pollution, whose working memory and attention were tested four times, every three months, from January 2012 to March 2013, with brain MRI in a subsample, to study the effects of traffic-related air pollution on cognitive and brain development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BDAPUSC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BREATHE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
