        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90274713</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium of large prospective cohorts in the United States, Europe and Australia, among them ATBC, CPS-II, EPIC, HPFS, the Multiethnic Cohort, NHS, PHS, PLCO and WHS, which pools nested case–control studies of breast and prostate cancer with DNA and prospectively collected questionnaire data, first to relate variation in genes of the steroid-hormone metabolism and insulin-like growth factor pathways to cancer risk, and later for genome-wide association studies of aggressive prostate cancer and oestrogen receptor-negative breast cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BPC3</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Breast and Prostate Cancer Cohort Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
