        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90104613</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective, multicentre, longitudinal observational cohort of patients with traumatic brain injury who presented to hospital within 24 hours of injury with an indication for CT, recruited between December 2014 and December 2017 at centres in 18 countries across Europe and in Israel. Funded by the European Union&apos;s Seventh Framework Programme, it comprises a core study, with neuroimaging, biospecimens and outcome assessment, and a broader registry, and aims to improve the characterisation and classification of TBI and to identify best clinical care through comparative effectiveness research.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CENTER-TBI</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Collaborative European NeuroTrauma Effectiveness Research</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Collaborative European NeuroTrauma Effectiveness Research in TBI</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Collaborative European Neurotrauma Effectiveness Research in TBI</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Collaborative European Neurotrauma Effectiveness Research in Traumatic Brain Injury</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Collaborative European NeuroTrauma Effectiveness Research in Traumatic Brain Injury</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001156"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90104613</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>A genome-wide association study of outcome from traumatic brain injury.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:35301180</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8927841/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The CENTER-TBI study recruited patients who presented with a history of TBI and met local guidelines for CT imaging.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001156"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective, multicentre, longitudinal observational cohort of patients with traumatic brain injury who presented to hospital within 24 hours of injury with an indication for CT, recruited between December 2014 and December 2017 at centres in 18 countries across Europe and in Israel. Funded by the European Union&apos;s Seventh Framework Programme, it comprises a core study, with neuroimaging, biospecimens and outcome assessment, and a broader registry, and aims to improve the characterisation and classification of TBI and to identify best clinical care through comparative effectiveness research.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25525693</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:31526754</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34351445</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001156"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>CENTER-TBI</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001156"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Israel"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8486724/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Collaborative European NeuroTrauma Effectiveness Research in TBI (CENTER-TBI, registered at clinicaltrials.gov NCT02210221) study is a prospective cohort study conducted in 63 centers from 18 countries across Europe and Israel between December 2014 and December 2017.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001156"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Netherlands"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8486724/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We grouped countries into seven regions: Baltic States (Latvia, and Lithuania), Eastern Europe (Hungary, Romania, and Serbia), Israel, Northern Europe (Denmark, Finland, Norway, and Sweden), Southern Europe (Italy, and Spain), the United Kingdom, and Western Europe (Austria, Belgium, France, Germany, the Netherlands).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


