        <obo:IAO_0000115>A family-based genetic study of atopic dermatitis run from Charité Universitätsmedizin Berlin, which recruited complete nuclear families, mostly German and a few Swedish, through at least two children with physician-diagnosed, moderate to severe atopic dermatitis that began before the age of two, and in its extended phase also unrelated children with such early-onset disease, recording asthma and hay fever at recruitment, for genetic studies of atopic dermatitis and allergic disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
