        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective population-based cohort of adults from the county of Västerbotten in northern Sweden, nested within the Northern Sweden Health and Disease Study, whose members had baseline health and lifestyle examinations in the Västerbotten Intervention Programme between 1985 and 2004, in the years of their 40th, 50th or 60th birthdays, with a repeat examination about ten years later. It was established in 2008 to study the genetics of cardiometabolic traits and interactions between genes and lifestyle.</owl:annotatedTarget>
