        <rdfs:comment>The Cystic Fibrosis Genome Project (CFGP) is comprised of individuals with CF recruited by the CF Twin and Sibling Study (TSS)15 and Cystic Fibrosis-Related Diabetes (CFRD) Study16 (Johns Hopkins University), Genetic Modifier Study (GMS)17,18,19 and GMS of Severe CF Liver Disease (GMS CFLD)20,21 (University of North Carolina), and Early Pseudomonas Infection Control Observational (EPIC Obs) Study22 (University of Washington and Seattle Children’s Hospital).</rdfs:comment>
