        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001191"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The second survey of the HUNT Study, conducted in 1995–97, to which all residents of Nord-Trøndelag, Norway, aged 20 or over were invited for questionnaires, interviews, a clinical examination and biological sampling. Its participants have consented to linkage with Norwegian health and administrative registries, and many of them have been genotyped.</owl:annotatedTarget>
