        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90728616</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre patient registry established in Japan in 2006 to register and follow up patients with amyotrophic lateral sclerosis across many participating institutions, collecting DNA samples and clinical data with periodic telephone follow-up to study the natural history, genetic background and prognosis of ALS.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>JaCALS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Japanese Consortium for ALS research</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Japanese Consortium for Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Japanese Consortium for Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis Research</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
