        <dcterms:title>A genome-wide association study identifies the GPM6A locus associated with age at onset in ALS.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41350806</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12680644/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The GWAS discovery phase included 2087 Japanese patients with ALS who were enrolled in the Japanese Consortium for Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis Research (JaCALS) registry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001195"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A multicentre patient registry established in Japan in 2006 to register and follow up patients with amyotrophic lateral sclerosis across many participating institutions, collecting DNA samples and clinical data with periodic telephone follow-up to study the natural history, genetic background and prognosis of ALS.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:31722307</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:41350806</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001195"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>JaCALS</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001195"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Japan"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31722307+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In Japan, a multicenter registration and follow-up system called the Japanese Consortium for Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis research (JaCALS) was built in 2006.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


