        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90281037</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nation-wide, monocentric, observational, longitudinal-prospective cohort of people with Parkinson&apos;s disease or atypical parkinsonism at any disease stage, and of control subjects without a neurodegenerative disorder, recruited since 2015 in Luxembourg and the surrounding Greater Region of Germany, France and Belgium within the National Centre of Excellence in Research on Parkinson&apos;s Disease (NCER-PD). Patients are followed up annually with deep clinical phenotyping and biosampling, to find markers for early diagnosis and progression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
