    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001219"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4422072/</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In brief, 76,693 men were enrolled in the trial from 10 centers in the United States from 1993 to 2001 and randomized to receive annual screening with prostate-specific antigen (PSA) for six years and digital rectal exam for the four years or referred to their physician for routine care.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001219"/>
