        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multi-site cross-sectional study of typically developing children, adolescents and young adults aged 3 to 20 years, recruited through local postings and outreach in eight metropolitan areas of the United States and assessed at ten US sites, with its coordinating centre at the University of California, San Diego, that collected developmental histories, cognitive assessments, multimodal brain imaging and genome-wide genotypes to create a shared repository for studying brain and cognitive development.</obo:IAO_0000115>
