        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90281037</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial run by the Parkinson Study Group, which enrolled people with early Parkinson&apos;s disease not yet requiring dopaminergic therapy at 65 sites in the United States and Canada between April 2002 and April 2004 to test whether the mixed lineage kinase inhibitor CEP-1347 could slow disease progression; the trial was stopped early for futility in 2005, and its participants were then followed in the observational PostCEPT study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PRECEPT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Parkinson Research Examination of CEP-1347 Trial/A Longitudinal Follow-up of the PRECEPT Study Cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
