        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12695632/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The PREFECT sample constituted N=1,796 cases who had a clinical diagnosis of MDD and were treated for a major depressive episode with electroconvulsive therapy (ECT)6 .</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
