        <obo:IAO_0000115>A breast cancer case-control genetics study, led from Vanderbilt University, that genotyped Chinese women with breast cancer and controls drawn from four population-based studies in urban Shanghai, China: the Shanghai Breast Cancer Study, the Shanghai Breast Cancer Survival Study, the Shanghai Women&apos;s Health Study and, for controls only, the Shanghai Endometrial Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SBCGS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
