        <rdfs:comment>The Chinese participants were drawn from Shanghai Breast Cancer Genetics Study 4 (SBCGS), which consists of the Shanghai Breast Cancer Study (SBCS), Shanghai 5 Breast Cancer Survival Study (SBCSS), Shanghai Endometrial Cancer Study 6 (SECS, contributed control data only), and the Shanghai Women’s Health Study 7 (SWHS), four large population-based studies in urban Shanghai.</rdfs:comment>
