    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001233 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001233">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Europe"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90662913</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of adults aged 16 or older with a clinical diagnosis of type 1 diabetes, latent autoimmune diabetes of adulthood or monogenic diabetes, recruited mainly at diabetes outpatient clinics across Scotland between December 2010 and November 2013, whose biosamples were banked and genotyped and who are followed through linkage to national electronic health records, set up to study the genetic determinants, biomarkers and complications of type 1 diabetes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SDRNT1BIO</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Scottish Diabetes Research Network Type 1 Bioresource Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Scottish Type 1 Bioresource</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Scottish Diabetes Research Network Type 1 Bioresource</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001233"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90662913</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genetics of C-Peptide and Age at Diagnosis in Type 1 Diabetes.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:39556808</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11755686/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We performed a meta-GWAS of C-peptide that including four T1D studies: the Scottish Diabetes Research Network Type 1 Bioresource (SDRNT1BIO) (4,16), Diabetes Control and Complications Trial (DCCT) (17,18), Coronary Artery Calcification in T1D (CACTI) (19,20), and Wisconsin Epidemiologic Study of Diabetic Retinopathy (WESDR) (21).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001233"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A cohort of adults aged 16 or older with a clinical diagnosis of type 1 diabetes, latent autoimmune diabetes of adulthood or monogenic diabetes, recruited mainly at diabetes outpatient clinics across Scotland between December 2010 and November 2013, whose biosamples were banked and genotyped and who are followed through linkage to national electronic health records, set up to study the genetic determinants, biomarkers and complications of type 1 diabetes.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28338705</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:42274395</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001233"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>SDRNT1BIO</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasSynonymType rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001233"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_Kingdom"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC5582633/unicode</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The SDRNT1BIO cohort was established using a cross-sectional design for the study fieldwork with recruitment primarily focused on 10 of 14 NHS Board regions in Scotland (Table 2).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001234 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001234">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Asia"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/China"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eastern_Asia"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90841197</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A case-control study of upper gastrointestinal cancers conducted from 1997 to 2007 by the Shanxi Cancer Hospital and Institute under contract with the US National Cancer Institute in Shanxi Province, China, in the high-risk western Taihang Mountain area, which enrolled adults newly diagnosed with oesophageal squamous cell carcinoma or gastric adenocarcinoma and treated surgically at the Shanxi Cancer Hospital, with neighbourhood controls matched on age and sex, plus a case-only component, and collected questionnaire data and blood to study genetic and environmental risk factors for these cancers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Shanxi</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Shanxi UGI Cancer Genetics Project</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shanxi Upper Gastrointestinal Cancer Genetics Project</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001234"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90841197</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome wide association analysis and association of genetic risk and lifestyle with upper gastrointestinal cancer among an endoscopy-screened cohort in China.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:41963194</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S2095927326003270-mmc1.docx</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Briefly, participants were drawn from multiple established studies, including the Shanxi Upper Gastrointestinal Cancer Genetics Project and the Linxian Nutrition Intervention Trial, as well as additional prospective cohort studies incorporating in the validation phase.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001234"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case-control study of upper gastrointestinal cancers conducted from 1997 to 2007 by the Shanxi Cancer Hospital and Institute under contract with the US National Cancer Institute in Shanxi Province, China, in the high-risk western Taihang Mountain area, which enrolled adults newly diagnosed with oesophageal squamous cell carcinoma or gastric adenocarcinoma and treated surgically at the Shanxi Cancer Hospital, with neighbourhood controls matched on age and sex, plus a case-only component, and collected questionnaire data and blood to study genetic and environmental risk factors for these cancers.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:20729852</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:21846596</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:28680059</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34022824</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
