        <rdfs:comment>We thank the University of Virginia for their support in genotyping samples from the Northern Irish GRID cohort, the IDDMGEN and T1DGEN cohorts from Finland and the Warren cohort using the T1DGC grant (U01 DK062418) and JDRF grant (JDRF 9-2011-530).</rdfs:comment>
