        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cohort of people with or at risk of type 1 diabetes recruited since 2001 by Type 1 Diabetes TrialNet, an international network of clinical research centres established by the US National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases: chiefly relatives of people with type 1 diabetes who are screened for islet autoantibodies and followed for progression in its Pathway to Prevention natural-history study, and people at risk of or newly diagnosed with type 1 diabetes enrolled in its trials aimed at delaying or preventing the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
