        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based breast cancer case-control study run from the University of California, Irvine, whose cases were breast cancer patients diagnosed in Orange County, California, in the year from March 1994, ascertained through the population-based Cancer Surveillance Program of Orange County and enrolled as probands in the UCI population-based breast and ovarian cancer family registry, and whose controls were Orange County residents recruited in 1998–2003 by random digit dialling and frequency-matched to cases by age and race/ethnicity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>UCIBCS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
