        <obo:IAO_0000115>A prospective, pan-India, multicentre study of people with juvenile-, young- and early-onset Parkinson&apos;s disease (onset by about 50 years of age), started by the Parkinson Research Alliance of India, which over two years recruited patients under the care of movement disorder specialists at ten specialty movement disorder centres and neurology clinics across India, to study the clinical and genetic patterns of early-onset Parkinson&apos;s disease in India.</obo:IAO_0000115>
