        <obo:IAO_0000115>A study of patients with critical COVID-19 admitted from March 2020 to the intensive care unit of Uppsala University Hospital, Sweden, who were enrolled in the prospective observational PronMed cohort and invited to follow-up three to six months after discharge, in which researchers at Uppsala University and Karolinska Institutet investigate the mechanisms of acute and long-term organ dysfunction in critical COVID-19, including its host genetics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym SweCovid-COMRI also denotes COVID-19 Kohortenstudie am Klinikum München Rechts der Isar (COHO:0001267); this term is SweCovid study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
