        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of pregnant women of diverse ethnic origin attending three public Child Health Clinics for antenatal care in Groruddalen, a multi-ethnic area of Oslo, Norway, recruited in 2008–2010 and followed with their offspring through pregnancy and after birth, to study gestational diabetes, physical activity and obesity in pregnancy and to identify predictors of gestational diabetes and fetal growth.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>STORK G</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>STORK Groruddalen research programme</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
