        <rdfs:comment>Data collection for the Stork Groruddalen study was funded by The Research Council of Norway, The South-Eastern Norway Regional Health Authority and the public Child Health Clinics in Stovner, Grorud and Bjerke districts in Oslo.</rdfs:comment>
