        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3390364/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Amish Family Osteoporosis Study (AFOS) study was designed to identify genetic determinants of osteoporosis in the Old Order Amish (OOA) population from Lancaster County, PA USA [49], [50].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
