        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multicentre, population-based case-control-family study in Australia, recruiting people with early-onset first-primary cutaneous melanoma, population-based and spouse or friend controls, and their relatives, between 2001 and 2005, to investigate genetic and environmental influences on melanoma risk.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AMFS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
