        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3390364/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Anglo-Australasian Osteoporosis Genetics Consortium (AOGC) study collected unrelated individuals with extreme BMD phenotypes as a powerful strategy for gene discovery in quantitative traits [11], [52].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
