        <rdfs:comment>We establish the German AugUR study (Age-related diseases: understanding genetic and non-genetic influences - a study at the University of Regensburg), a prospective study in the mobile elderly general population in and around Regensburg in eastern Bavaria.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


