        <obo:IAO_0000115>A UK collection of adults with Dupuytren&apos;s disease who had been treated surgically for it. Saliva samples for DNA, and diseased palmar fascia removed at surgery, were collected by the British Society for Surgery of the Hand Genetics of Dupuytren&apos;s Disease (BSSH-GODD) consortium for genetic studies of the disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BSSH-GODD</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
