        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5591021/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The UK cohort consisted of a total of 5,408 case subjects from the BSSH-GODD Study and 9,961 population-based control subjects from the United Kingdom Household Longitudinal Study (UKHLS), which were divided into 4,891 control subjects for the discovery phase and 5,070 control subjects for the replication phase.</rdfs:comment>
