        <rdfs:comment>All patients who visited the Division of Cardiology at a university hospital, for a health check-up or due to chest symptoms from January 2001 to August 2009 were included in the CGC cohort.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
