        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nationwide, population-based cohort of long-term testicular cancer survivors treated in Denmark in 1984–2007, identified in the Danish Testicular Cancer (DaTeCa) clinical database and surveyed by questionnaire on late effects in 2014–2016 by the Department of Oncology at Rigshospitalet, Copenhagen University Hospital, with linked hospital, pathology and national registry data and a biobank of blood and sputum samples, set up to analyse late effects of treatment and inform future follow-up programmes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
