        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9378791/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The fourth cohort (Dental SCORE, n = 548) is a subset of a larger project, Heart SCORE, which is an ongoing cardiovascular disease study of 2,000 middle aged White and African Americans in the Pittsburgh region of Pennsylvania [17].</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
