        <obo:IAO_0000115>A French case–control sample of people of European ancestry assembled for a genome-wide association study of type 2 diabetes: people with type 2 diabetes, a family history of diabetes in first-degree relatives and a BMI below 30, recruited at the CNRS UMR8090 unit in Lille and the Endocrinology-Diabetology Department of the Corbeil-Essonnes Hospital, and normoglycaemic controls drawn mostly from the D.E.S.I.R. cohort of volunteers attending French health examination centres.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>DGDG</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
