        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A French case–control sample of people of European ancestry assembled for a genome-wide association study of type 2 diabetes: people with type 2 diabetes, a family history of diabetes in first-degree relatives and a BMI below 30, recruited at the CNRS UMR8090 unit in Lille and the Endocrinology-Diabetology Department of the Corbeil-Essonnes Hospital, and normoglycaemic controls drawn mostly from the D.E.S.I.R. cohort of volunteers attending French health examination centres.</owl:annotatedTarget>
