        <rdfs:comment>Patients in the discovery set were adult, African American participants from the Diabetes Multi-omic Investigation of Drug Response (DIAMOND), a cohort study of patients with T2D from a health system serving southeast Michigan.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
