        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10864182/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>A total of 58 cases, which were defined at the baseline visit, and 436 controls of African ancestry were included in our MD GWAS for the DNHS cohort.</rdfs:comment>
