        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11746137/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The FOR2107 consortium was established to investigate the neurobiology of affective disorders.</rdfs:comment>
