        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2957428/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The following geographic locales were defined across three continents: Europe—France (Paris), Italy (Emilia-Romagna and Genoa), the Netherlands (Leiden), Spain (Barcelona), Sweden (Lund, Stockholm), and United Kingdom (Glasgow, Leeds); North America—Boston, NCI, Philadelphia, and Toronto; Australia—Brisbane and Sydney.</rdfs:comment>
