        <rdfs:comment>the analysis utilised 2,804 cases (2,692 European and 112 Israeli) and 1,835 controls from GenoMEL studies and 5,783 controls from France and the UK Wellcome Trust Case-Control Consortium (WTCCC).</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
