        <obo:IAO_0000115>A retrospective, population-based cohort of Koreans who had health check-ups at the Healthcare System Gangnam Center of Seoul National University Hospital in Seoul, South Korea, from October 2003, with repeated check-up data, advanced diagnostic imaging and record linkage for cancer and death, designed to investigate the association of diagnostic imaging results and biomarkers with the predisease stage of non-communicable diseases such as cancers and metabolic diseases in an average-risk population.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>H-PEACE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Health and Prevention Enhancement cohort</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
