        <dcterms:title>Multi-ancestry meta-analysis of host genetic susceptibility to tuberculosis identifies shared genetic architecture.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38224499</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A38224499+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We established the International Tuberculosis Host Genetics Consortium to perform a multi-ancestry meta-analysis of GWAS, including 14,153 cases and 19,536 controls of African, Asian, and European ancestry.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
