        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The acronym Korea-NCC also denotes Korea National Cancer Center gastric cancer case-control study (COHO:0001363); this term is Korea-NCC (National Cancer Center) Colorectal Cancer Study.</obo:IAO_0000116>
