        <rdfs:comment>Data from the Korean-National Cancer Center CRC Study (Korea validation set: a case-control study including 622 cases and 832 controls) and a case-control study nested in cohorts of the Shanghai Men’s Health Study and Shanghai Women’s Health Study (China validation set: 868 cases and 868 age- and sex-frequency matched controls) were used for model validation.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
