        <obo:IAO_0000115>A genomic database drawn from the second phase of the 2016 Mexican National Survey of Tobacco, Alcohol, and Drug Use (Encodat 2016), a nationwide household survey that excluded regions where most people speak a Native American language, whose participants answered questionnaires on substance use and psychiatric symptoms and gave buccal DNA samples, assembled by Mexico&apos;s National Institute of Psychiatry Ramón de la Fuente Muñiz and National Institute of Genomic Medicine for genetic studies of addiction and related psychiatric and pharmacogenetic traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ENCODAT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
