        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38714835</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11269173/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Those from Mexico were part of the subsample MxGDAR-Encodat [17] from the Mexican National Survey of Tobacco, Alcohol, and Drug Use [18], which found an ADHD prevalence of 1.4% based on a questionnaire used to assign participants to the ADHD group.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
