        <owl:annotatedTarget>A population-based prospective cohort of Han Chinese adults, a sub-project of China&apos;s National Science &amp; Technology Basic Research Project, recruited as volunteers in four sub-cohorts in Taizhou (Jiangsu province; 2015 and 2019), Zhengzhou (Henan province; 2017) and Nanning (Guangxi province; 2018). Participants were photographed and assessed for physical traits such as facial, ear and fingerprint features, and gave blood for genotyping and for DNA methylation, proteomic and metabolomic profiling, to study the genetic and molecular basis of human physical traits and common diseases.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:34995520</obo:IAO_0000119>
