        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90554823</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An international consortium that pools data from case-control studies of pancreatic cancer, conducted in North America, Europe, China and Australia, to study risk factors such as tobacco and alcohol use, diabetes and pancreatitis; cases and controls from several member studies were also genotyped together for a genome-wide association study of pancreatic cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>International Pancreatic Cancer Case-Control Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>PanC4</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Panc4</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
