        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pancreatic Cancer Case-Control Consortium</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001387"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>GCST90554823</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>Genome-Wide Analysis to Assess if Heavy Alcohol Consumption Modifies the Association between SNPs and Pancreatic Cancer Risk.</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:38869494</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC11928872</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Data from study participants in three previously conducted genome-wide association studies of pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma in European ancestry populations, the PanScan I-II studies, and the PanC4 study (Figure 1) were used in these analyses.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001387"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>An international consortium that pools data from case-control studies of pancreatic cancer, conducted in North America, Europe, China and Australia, to study risk factors such as tobacco and alcohol use, diabetes and pancreatitis; cases and controls from several member studies were also genotyped together for a genome-wide association study of pancreatic cancer.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:22104574</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26098869</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:26646264</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <dcterms:contributor>Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09</dcterms:contributor>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001387"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym"/>
