        <obo:IAO_0000115>A research tissue bank at the UCL Queen Square Institute of Neurology in London that archives brains and other tissue from donors across the UK, registered through its donor scheme during life, who had neurological and mostly neurodegenerative diseases such as Parkinson&apos;s disease, multiple system atrophy and progressive supranuclear palsy, and from neurologically normal controls, and supplies well-characterised tissue and data for research.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>QSBB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Queen Square Brain Bank</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
