        <rdfs:comment>The following studies have previously been described: ARIC8 , BBJ9 , deCODE10 , DiscovEHR10 , FHS8 , HUNT10 , KAFN11 , MESA6 , MGI10 , MGH CAMP6 , PHB12 , SiGN13 , SPHFC6 , UKBB14 and WGHS8 .</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
