        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90027859</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium of research groups worldwide, established to increase sample sizes for genome-wide association meta-analysis of asthma, that pooled asthma genome-wide association studies of European, African, Japanese and Latino ancestry, among them studies of the GABRIEL, EVE, EAGLE, APCAT, CARe and Australian Asthma Genetics consortia, into a multi-ancestry meta-analysis, with a separate analysis of childhood-onset asthma, to identify asthma risk loci.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TAGC</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho#GWAS_subset"/>
