        <obo:IAO_0000115>The part of the European NAFLD Registry, a prospective observational cohort of adults with non-alcoholic fatty liver disease sponsored by Newcastle University, made up of patients with biopsy-characterised NAFLD who were recruited at liver centres across Europe from 2010 to December 2017 in the FLIP, EPoS and HEPAmet studies of NAFLD pathogenesis, or came from earlier single-centre cohorts, and used by the IMI2 LITMUS project to evaluate non-invasive biomarkers. Patients recruited since 2018 form the Registry&apos;s separate LITMUS Study Cohort.</obo:IAO_0000115>
