        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90671959</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based prospective cohort of adults from urban and rural areas of Taizhou, Jiangsu Province, China, initiated in 2007 by Fudan University and the Taizhou government, with baseline interviews, physical examinations, biochemical assays and collection of blood and other biospecimens, and follow-up through health records and repeated assessments, to study environmental and genetic risk factors for common non-communicable diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TZL</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>TZLS</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
