        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10632148/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The UK Aneurysm Growth Study (UKAGS) is a prospective study of men attending the NHS aneurysm screening programmes in the UK at reaching age 65.</rdfs:comment>
