        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8521585/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>We used 298 controls from a randomly ascertained sample from the WOBASZ II (Multicentre National Population Health Examination Survey) study, a population-based Polish cohort54.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
