        <obo:IAO_0000112>GCST90000618</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A consortium, formed in 2008, of cohort studies from the United Kingdom, the United States, Canada, the Netherlands, Germany, Sweden, Italy and Finland that meta-analyses their genome-wide association results for circulating 25-hydroxyvitamin D concentration in people of European descent, to identify genetic determinants of vitamin D status and insufficiency.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SUNLIGHT</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>SUNLIGHT Consortium</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
