        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>A prospective, multi-ethnic birth cohort run from Amsterdam UMC that recruited pregnant women living in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, at their first prenatal visit between January 2003 and March 2004, and follows their children from pregnancy into young adulthood to identify factors in pregnancy and early childhood that explain later health and health inequalities, with particular attention to differences between ethnic groups.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:41550966</obo:IAO_0000119>
