        <owl:annotatedTarget>A case–control collection of the Psychiatric Genetics Unit of the Vall d&apos;Hebron Research Institute (VHIR) in Barcelona, Spain, of adults of European origin with attention-deficit hyperactivity disorder, recruited and evaluated at the Hospital Universitari Vall d&apos;Hebron, and of unrelated blood donors screened for lifetime ADHD symptoms, genotyped genome-wide to identify loci conferring susceptibility to persistent ADHD.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:25284319</obo:IAO_0000119>
