        <rdfs:comment>All patients were adults of Caucasian origin, recruited and evaluated at the Hospital Universitari Vall d’Hebron located in Barcelona (Spain), and met Diagnostic and Statistical Manual for Mental Disorders-IV (DSM-IV) criteria for ADHD.</rdfs:comment>
