        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:40691366</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A biobank study at University Medical Center Utrecht and St. Antonius Hospital Nieuwegein, the Netherlands, set up in 2003 as a derivative of the Athero-Express, of patients undergoing open surgical repair of abdominal aortic and other arterial aneurysms, which stores aneurysm wall tissue collected during surgery together with blood, clinical data and three years of follow-up for cardiovascular events, to study aneurysm heterogeneity in relation to postoperative outcomes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>AEB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
