        <obo:IAO_0000115>A biobank and ongoing prospective registry of patients with atrial fibrillation from the arrhythmia clinic of the Department of Medicine I, University Hospital Munich, Ludwig-Maximilians-University, Germany, established within the Arrhythmia-Biobank-LMU with support from the German Federal Ministry of Education and Research, which collects blood samples and clinical data and follows patients for recurrence of atrial fibrillation after rhythm-control interventions such as catheter ablation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
