        <obo:IAO_0000115>A registry of patients with heart disease treated at the University of Lübeck hospital (University Hospital Schleswig-Holstein, Campus Lübeck) in Germany, with blood samples and clinical data, whose angiography sample (Angio-Lueb) consists of consecutive patients referred for coronary angiography and classified from the angiogram as having coronary artery disease or myocardial infarction or not. It has provided cases for genetic association studies of coronary artery disease, with population controls from KORA, and of dilated cardiomyopathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
