        <rdfs:comment>For the Alberta Ovarian Tumor Types study (AOV), Calgary Serous Carcinoma study (CAL), Nottingham Ovarian Cancer study (NOT), Toronto Ovarian Cancer study (TOC) and British Columbia Cancer Agency study (VAN), the institutional research ethics boards waived the need to obtain consent and all local human research investigations committees approved each study.</rdfs:comment>
