    <!-- http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001491 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001491">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000000"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Australia"/>
        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Oceania"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:29892016</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A national prostate cancer tissue bank in Australia, organised as a network of nodes in several states (among them Queensland, New South Wales and South Australia), that since the mid-2000s has collected radical prostatectomy tissue, blood, and clinical, pathology and follow-up data from men with prostate cancer, recruited through their urologists at diagnosis or before surgery at participating hospitals under common standard operating procedures, and supplies them for research, including genetic association studies of prostate cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>APCB</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Australian Prostate Cancer BioResource</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001491"/>
