        <coho:has_data_collection_location rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/United_States"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:23563134</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multinational, randomised, double-blind, double-dummy phase 3 trial, sponsored by Bristol-Myers Squibb and Pfizer, in which patients with atrial fibrillation or atrial flutter and at least one additional risk factor for stroke, enrolled from 2006 at over 1,000 centres in about 40 countries, were randomly assigned to apixaban or warfarin to test whether apixaban is non-inferior to warfarin in preventing stroke or systemic embolism. The trial ended in 2011; its participants&apos; baseline blood samples and genotypes have since been used in biomarker and genetic studies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>ARISTOTLE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Apixaban for reduction in stroke and other ThromboemboLic events in atrial fibrillation</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Apixaban for the Prevention of Stroke in Subjects With Atrial Fibrillation</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Apixaban for Reduction in Stroke and Other Thromboembolic Events in Atrial Fibrillation</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001493"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>PMID:23563134</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <dcterms:title>N-terminal pro-B-type natriuretic peptide for risk assessment in patients with atrial fibrillation: insights from the ARISTOTLE Trial (Apixaban for the Prevention of Stroke in Subjects With Atrial Fibrillation).</dcterms:title>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:23563134</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A23563134+AND+SRC%3AMED&amp;format=json&amp;resultType=core</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>In the ARISTOTLE trial, 18,201 patients with AF were randomized to apixaban or warfarin.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001493"/>
