        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:33079599</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7889287/supplementaryFiles</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The British Columbia Familial Hypercholesterolemia (BCFH) cohort is a prospective, longitudinal, open observational study of adults (≥18 years) with clinically diagnosed heterozygous familial hypercholesterolemia (FH) in the Canadian province of British Columbia, Canada.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
