        <coho:isSubCohortOf rdf:resource="http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000668"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:32665703</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The New York site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry, known as the Metropolitan New York Registry and run from Columbia University in New York City, which from 1995 enrolled families with breast or ovarian cancer through clinical and community settings in the New York metropolitan area (New York, New Jersey and Connecticut), including Ashkenazi Jewish and minority families, when a woman had breast or ovarian cancer before age 45 or both cancers, a man had breast cancer, several relatives were affected or a BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation was known. Affected and unaffected probands and their relatives gave family-history and epidemiological questionnaires and blood samples and are contacted annually for follow-up, for studies of the genetic epidemiology of breast cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>BCFR-NY</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>MNYR</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Metropolitan NY Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Metropolitan New York Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Metropolitan New York Registry of Breast Cancer Families</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>New York Site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>New York site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">New York Breast Cancer Family Registry</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
