        <rdfs:comment>BCFR Breast Cancer Family Registry USA, Canada, Australia BCFR-NY New York site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry BCFR-PA Philadelphia site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry BCFR-UTAH Utah site of the Breast Cancer Family Registry</rdfs:comment>
