        <obo:IAO_0000115>A South African study of BRCA1 and BRCA2 mutations in women with breast cancer and their families, based at the University of Pretoria and funded by the Cancer Association of South Africa. The women it identifies as carriers of pathogenic BRCA1 or BRCA2 variants are contributed to the Consortium of Investigators of Modifiers of BRCA1/2 (CIMBA) for studies of genetic modifiers of breast and ovarian cancer risk in carriers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
