        <obo:IAO_0000115>An ongoing population-based cohort of people aged over 18 years in Amagasaki, Hyogo Prefecture, Japan, consecutively enrolled for a baseline examination between September 2002 and August 2003, which is one of the member studies of the Cardio-metabolic Genome Epidemiology (CAGE) Network and whose samples are used in genetic studies of blood pressure, lipids and other cardiometabolic traits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
