        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:20205615</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A community-based prospective cohort of middle-aged and older Japanese men and women in Fukuoka, Japan, run by Kyushu University, who took part in a baseline survey with a questionnaire and DNA collection between February 2004 and August 2007 and are followed up to investigate lifestyle factors and genetic susceptibility to lifestyle-related diseases such as cardiovascular diseases, cancer and diabetes mellitus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
