        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hospital-based prospective cohort at the National Center for Global Health and Medicine in Tokyo, Japan, whose participants, drawn from the hospital&apos;s clinical practice and annual medical check-ups, are enrolled for detailed examination of lifestyle and lifestyle-related diseases such as cardiovascular diseases, cancer and diabetes mellitus to investigate the relationship between genetic and non-genetic factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>CAGE-NCGM</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>NCGM Hospital-based Cohort Study</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
