        <obo:IAO_0000112>PMID:35195259</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A population-based cohort of Chinese men and women aged 35–59, selected in 1998 by cluster random sampling in several provinces of China for the 1998 survey of the China Multi-Center Collaborative Study of Cardiovascular Epidemiology (a separate sample from that study&apos;s 1992–1994 cohort), whose participants were followed up in 2007–2008, 2012–2015 and 2018–2020 under the uniform protocol of the China-PAR project to study cardiovascular risk factors and incident atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China MUCA (1998)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China MUCA 1998</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>China MUCA-1998</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
