        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2394344/fullTextXML</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>The Colorectal Cancer Genetic Susceptibility (COGS) study aims to evaluate a new Scottish-wide research strategy for identifying individuals at high risk of developing HNPCC.</rdfs:comment>
